1	1	gmail	19999fbc85daa0a2	outbound	info@enschedayinn.nl	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Hope You Enjoyed Your Stay!	Hello again,\r\nI hope you had a pleasant trip and that you enjoyed your stay with us.\r\nI'm reaching out to kindly ask for your feedback. We're always working to make our guest experience the best it can be, and your insights are key to that. If you have a moment, we'd appreciate it if you could share your thoughts on your stay with us.\r\nFor any future visits or recommendations for friends, here is the link to our digital booklet: https://notre.guide/centraldayinn/.\r\nThank you once again for your visit.\r\nBest regards,\r\nAlbertoLocation Manager	2025-09-30 09:37:18+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19999fbc85daa0a2", "threadId": "19999fbc85daa0a2", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Hello again, I hope you had a pleasant trip and that you enjoyed your stay with us. I&#39;m reaching out to kindly ask for your feedback. We&#39;re always working to make our guest experience the best", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Return-Path", "value": "<info@enschedayinn.nl>"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "from mail.xmlcal.com (mail.beds24.com. [188.34.132.40])        by smtp.gmail.com with ESMTPSA id a640c23a62f3a-b3ca6592cadsm524192266b.31.2025.09.30.02.37.18        for <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>        (version=TLS1_3 cipher=TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 bits=256/256);        Tue, 30 Sep 2025 02:37:18 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "From", "value": "info@enschedayinn.nl"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Tue, 30 Sep 2025 09:37:18 +0000"}, {"name": "Return-Path", "value": "info@enschedayinn.nl"}, {"name": "Reply-To", "value": "info@enschedayinn.nl"}, {"name": "To", "value": "brandscheffer@protonmail.com"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Hope You Enjoyed Your Stay!"}, {"name": "X-Action-Id", "value": "manual action 521106 booking 69986903 account 69021 sent using 69021"}, {"name":