2	1	gmail	1999fad8024e1f8f	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@enschedayinn.nl	Re: Hope You Enjoyed Your Stay!	Hi Alberto\n\nThanks for reaching out. As I said to Sander in my recent emails, my stay with you was fine. You attended to my needs effectively whenever I needed something, which wasn't very often, but you were always helpful and friendy, so that was much appreciated.\n\nIf you really want some frank feedback, for me, the single most relevant aspect of my stay was the price. I often go to California for work and stay in similar rental accomadation for a similar amount of time. I am invariably in Southern California, outside of LA in an apartment complex of different houses and condos. For the same amount of money I spent with you, I get 2 bedrooms, a kitchen / diner, living room with fire place and a large terrace / balcony where I can eat or lounge on a deckchair.\n\nSo the price shock for me was huge. I appreciate Holland is more expensive now than when I last lived in Amersvoort, but that was my main concern. I also noticed that for long term rental properties, prices are aboviously a lot lower. One consideration might be a price break structure that allowed for a rental reduction for 1 month stay, or 2 month stays for example.\n\nIn any case that was my only negative feedback. Everything else was fine. If I need to come back, I will certainly reach out to you.\n\nKind regarfs\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n\nOn Tuesday, 30 September 2025 at 11:37, info@enschedayinn.nl <info@enschedayinn.nl> wrote:\n\n> Hello again,\n>\n> I hope you had a pleasant trip and that you enjoyed your stay with us.\n>\n> I'm reaching out to kindly ask for your feedback. We're always working to make our guest experience the best it can be, and your insights are key to that. If you have a moment, we'd appreciate it if you could share your thoughts on your stay with us.\n>\n> For any future visits or recommendations for friends, here is the link to our digital booklet: https://notre.guide/centraldayinn/.\n>\n> Thank you once again for your visit.\n>\n> Best regards,\n>\n> Alberto\n> Location Manager	2025-10-01 12:09:28+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1999fad8024e1f8f", "threadId": "19999fbc85daa0a2", "labelIds": ["IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL", "INBOX"], "snippet": "Hi Alberto Thanks for reaching out. As I said to Sander in my recent emails, my stay with you was fine. You attended to my needs effectively whenever I needed something, which wasn&#39;t very often,", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@enschedayinn.nl"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6214:2d44:b0:7f0:6d91:445d with SMTP id na4csp301963qvb;        Wed, 1 Oct 2025 05:09:32 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "X-Google-Smtp-Source", "value": "AGHT+IF8eJW239Af6YeJlfc7QRLNpBxidBHViev5Ir+GggzwrvStRfQG58W03sjK6Vrb23QZ0+BK"}, {"name": "X-Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6000:4383:b0:3f4:5bda:2710 with SMTP id ffacd0b85a97d-4240f823767mr6484720f8f.9.1759320572376;        Wed, 01 Oct 2025 05:09:32 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "ARC-Seal", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; t=1759320572; cv=none;        d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        b=UfxflYUrA7bPTACdAv0v7Js6Kl32gcw2Yem70aF+bS5IFdPlU7YaClZmd/03o7B/NA         /4IDuTvZdCWbwVepVuz/+P0P8RGMBJBzA66uZXJNvPDsS3ygJ+Y0z3JxrHy7IKp8FqUR         WzRD5vm39WgrUSO8uSUF5IGCZx/M/QaGLKtLM7wlZ1cbdH+PaHbdqtGoVT5zCUS7dEgb         El+IkqmUzJa/d8TDIJaLCtkDu3BEWhXtJ55JqB32iUlZf+L1TXMzE7jfwR9iGpoMufFq         +A6OMDFJIuPCqgUFzYWC/0m+Pc5s/BAvV/TGZFMurzrYVbdOxuXVu+DtAUjraFEBNjeE         HC1g=="}, {"name": "ARC-Message-Signature", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; c=relaxed/relaxed; d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        h=mime-version:feedback-id:references:in-reply-to:message-id:subject         :from:to:date:dkim-signature;        bh=4q+YiVjlcm3ho9OqFZqQG0piyOivuYe0aYEy5WbpmMk=;        fh=hDcLZ2APqa3Qr0Fw