3	2	gmail	1992d81e124c3f50	outbound	info@enschedayinn.nl	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	How is everything going?	Hello Brand,\r\n\r\nHope you're having a wonderful stay with us!\r\n\r\nI'm checking in to see how everything is going and to make sure you have\r\neverything you need. We'd also love to get your thoughts on the room and\r\nyour overall experience so far. Your feedback is really important to us and\r\nhelps us make things even better for our guests.\r\n\r\nIf you need any information about the area, tips for places to eat, or\r\nthings to do, you can find a lot of helpful information in our digital\r\nbooklet here: https://notre.guide/centraldayinn/.\r\n\r\nIf there's anything else at all we can do to make your stay more\r\ncomfortable, please don't hesitate to let us know.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nAlberto\r\nLocation Manager\r\n	2025-09-09 08:05:06+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1992d81e124c3f50", "threadId": "1992d8181d4ac294", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Hello Brand, Hope you&#39;re having a wonderful stay with us! I&#39;m checking in to see how everything is going and to make sure you have everything you need. We&#39;d also love to get your thoughts", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Tue, 9 Sep 2025 10:05:06 +0200"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CALasHttpU1BQLkHDM8cJaP6L8j+OocL3DrPMxp4qDWNc+cmNig@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "How is everything going?"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Guest House Ensche-Day Inn <info@enschedayinn.nl>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "brandscheffer@protonmail.com"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\\"0000000000005310e2063e59c3eb\\""}], "body": {"size": 0}, "parts": [{"partId": "0", "mimeType": "text/plain", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}], "body": {"size": 702, "data": ""}}, {"partId":