6	5	gmail	19ea43cbca758c6f	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Your Check-In Information	Dear Brand,\r\n\r\nThank you for choosing to stay with us at Central-Day Inn. We are delighted to confirm your reservation and look forward to welcoming you on Wednesday, 10 June, 2026\r\n\r\nTo ensure a smooth check-in experience, we kindly ask you to use the code 3719 to enter the building on the day of your arrival starting at 16.00. Please note that this code is the only valid code for check-in, and you should not use any other code received from other sources. After check-in, you can use the key provided in your room to access the building and lock your room. You will also find a flip book in your room with all the necessary information regarding your stay.\r\nYour room number is 4 (on the second floor). Should you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us.\r\n\r\nWe hope you have a comfortable and enjoyable stay with us.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nAlberto from Central-Day Inn\r\n12-D Deurningerstraat, 7514BH Enschede	2026-06-07 22:38:22+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19ea43cbca758c6f", "threadId": "19ea43cbca758c6f", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Brand, Thank you for choosing to stay with us at Central-Day Inn. We are delighted to confirm your reservation and look forward to welcoming you on Wednesday, 10 June, 2026 To ensure a smooth", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Return-Path", "value": "<info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "from mail.xmlcal.com (mail.beds24.com. [188.34.132.40])        by smtp.gmail.com with ESMTPSA id 5b1f17b1804b1-490bc3c1149sm299675535e9.4.2026.06.07.15.38.22        for <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>        (version=TLS1_3 cipher=TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 bits=256/256);        Sun, 07 Jun 2026 15:38:24 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortsta