10	6	gmail	19eb5a96313ae588	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Ist rent payment	Hi Brand,\r\nHow are you?\r\nI noticed my whatsapp messages did not arrive yesterday. Do you have\r\nanother active number now that you are here in the Netherlands?\r\n\r\nSee you soon!\r\n\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\nOn Wed, 10 Jun 2026 at 13:44, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Good to know, I’ll sort it when I get there.  Not sure about arrival time\r\n> but looks like a little before 3pm.\r\n>\r\n> If the room is not ready I’ll just leave my suitcase and go have a coffee,\r\n> if that all right.\r\n>\r\n> Best\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent from Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> for iOS.\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> -------- Original Message --------\r\n> On Monday, 06/08/26 at 14:00 Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hi Brand,\r\n>\r\n> Good to hear from you. I just checked, but did not receive the payment, I\r\n> did however received the creditcard digits but not cvc number. But for me\r\n> it is totally fine to figure it out when you are in the Netherlands. So no\r\n> rush.\r\n>\r\n> If I am not mistaken you have received the check in details last night.\r\n> This is an automated message, did you receive it?\r\n>\r\n> See you soon!\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>\r\n> On Sat, 6 Jun 2026 at 18:14, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Hi Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> I made the first rent payment via the credit card option, using the\r\n>> portal you gave me.  It seemed to go fine and I received a 'Thank You'\r\n>> notice, but I don't see it on my credit card yet.\r\n>>\r\n>> Please let me know if you got it OK otherwise I'll just do it the way I\r\n>> did the last payment.\r\n>>\r\n>> BTW  which bell do I ring when I get to you?\r\n>>\r\n>> Thanks see you soon\r\n>>\r\n>> Regards\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n	2026-06-11 07:50:37+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19eb5a96313ae588", "threadId": "19e9db6e9cf03378", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Hi Brand, How are you? I noticed my whatsapp messages did not arrive yesterday. Do you have another active number now that you are here in the Netherlands? See you soon! Kind regards, Sander On Wed, 10", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Thu, 11 Jun 2026 09:50:37 +0200"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<sTt0K24wr_f0Z4r_uD_0ROHynqFa1-OPgXsIkhu09pvr0N51IFJvY4K4ffQpB78-Gn_agbbgBVB3VuyKaUiBBBr63cbuy3XniOA3kG9pQKA=@protonmail.com> <CAHrPiLgRBTFm3Yu0NAq3yLWEDiJdjaUgt2cmR04e31vYN_tKrQ@mail.gmail.com> <87VujayWBPhkz_tGgyBiV5B_95HA0mIiuijTi1qp-BUmEcpPBuSnIOkxhiLUAztiflorkfUbR2L-VXRJFX6wHSge_I7KwDO1ZeyrISadCUo=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<87VujayWBPhkz_tGgyBiV5B_95HA0mIiuijTi1qp-BUmEcpPBuSnIOkxhiLUAztiflorkfUbR2L-VXRJFX6wHSge_I7KwDO1ZeyrISadCUo=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAHrPiLhe+CCr7DS+btSEOkvpKQhQQ33WLCqoQnNmE4EWSAnmJQ@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: Ist rent payment"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\\"000000000000aacafb0653f59d80\\""}], "body": {"size": 0}, "parts": [{"partId": "0", "mimeType": "text/plain", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}, {"name": "Content-Transfer-Encoding", "value": "quoted-printable"}], "body": {"size": 1862, "data": "-IGJ1dCBsb29rcyBsaWtlIGEgbGl0dGxlIGJlZm9yZSAzcG0uDQo-DQo-IElmIHRoZSByb29tIGlzIG5vdCByZWFkeSBJ4oCZbGwganVzdCBsZWF2ZSBteSBzdWl0Y2FzZSBhbmQgZ28gaGF2ZSBhIGNvZmZlZSwNCj4ga