11	6	gmail	19eb5b4f4957e440	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Re: Ist rent payment	Hi Sander\n\nEverything went a bit wrong yesterday, the train strike meant I went a different route than the usual Amersfoort change, and so I ended up changing at Deventer, except no one told me so I ended up going way too far in the wrong direction.\n\nBy the time I realized I had to change and go back for an hour before I could get back to Deventer, and by then my phone had died. Anyway, by the time I got here I think it was about 5 pm and my jet lag kicked in and I lay down and fell asleep!\n\nI will keep both phones live for a while an slowly switch. So, you can message me on either phone.\n\nI will try the rent payment again and make sure the svc code is on there. That should be an immediate payment.\n\nAlso when you have a moment if you could drop off the garbage authorization tag that would be great, I didn't see it in the kitchen cupboard.\n\nLook forward to seeing you.\n\nBest\n\nBrand\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\nUS phone: 1 (714) 955-2056\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n\nOn Thursday, June 11th, 2026 at 3:51 AM, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n\n> Hi Brand,\n> How are you?\n> I noticed my whatsapp messages did not arrive yesterday. Do you have another active number now that you are here in the Netherlands?\n>\n> See you soon!\n>\n> Kind regards, Sander\n>\n> On Wed, 10 Jun 2026 at 13:44, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\n>\n>> Good to know, I’ll sort it when I get there. Not sure about arrival time but looks like a little before 3pm.\n>>\n>> If the room is not ready I’ll just leave my suitcase and go have a coffee, if that all right.\n>>\n>> Best\n>>\n>> Brand Scheffer\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>\n>> Sent from [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) for iOS.\n>>\n>> -------- Original Message --------\n>> On Monday, 06/08/26 at 14:00 Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n>>\n>>> Hi Brand,\n>>>\n>>> Good to hear from you. I just checked, but did not receive the payment, I did however received the creditcard digits but not cvc number. But for me it is totally fine to figure it out when you are in the Netherlands. So no rush.\n>>>\n>>> If I am not mistaken you have received the check in details last night. This is an automated message, did you receive it?\n>>>\n>>> See you soon!\n>>>\n>>> Kind regards, Sander\n>>>\n>>> On Sat, 6 Jun 2026 at 18:14, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\n>>>\n>>>> Hi Sander\n>>>>\n>>>> I made the first rent payment via the credit card option, using the portal you gave me. It seemed to go fine and I received a 'Thank You' notice, but I don't see it on my credit card yet.\n>>>>\n>>>> Please let me know if you got it OK otherwise I'll just do it the way I did the last payment.\n>>>>\n>>>> BTW which bell do I ring when I get to you?\n>>>>\n>>>> Thanks see you soon\n>>>>\n>>>> Regards\n>>>>\n>>>> Brand Scheffer\n>>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>>>\n>>>> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2026-06-11 08:03:08+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19eb5b4f4957e440", "threadId": "19e9db6e9cf03378", "labelIds": ["IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL", "INBOX"], "snippet": "Hi Sander Everything went a bit wrong yesterday, the train strike meant I went a different route than the usual Amersfoort change, and so I ended up changing at Deventer, except no one told me so I", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6a10:678d:b0:6fc:cdf8:b0df with SMTP id p13csp163076pxu;        Thu, 11 Jun 2026 01:03:15 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "X-Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:690e:d8a:b0:660:5a7b:9d7f with SMTP id 956f58d0204a3-66269602728mr1363912d50.15.1781164995659;        Thu, 11 Jun 2026 01:03:15 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "ARC-Seal", "va