14	6	gmail	19ebb566ddc9690a	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Ist rent payment	Hi Brand,\r\n\r\nA few minutes ago I have send the updated overview, in here you can find 2\r\nblue quicklinks. these go to stripe payment option with creditcard option.\r\nPlease use these for the payment.\r\n\r\nThank you for the feedback, this is super helpfull!\r\nIt is correct that the standard materials are supose to be there waithing\r\nfor the tenant. They should be also in the closet in the hallway on the\r\nleft side, that is should be accasible for the tenants.\r\n\r\nYes I kept the topper and washed the outer cover last week, Alberto placed\r\nit for you last wednesday. you are welcome!\r\n\r\nIt is good that you told me about the hairs, these are exactly the things\r\nthat I need as feedback and I am happy you are not making a fuzz out of it.\r\nBut still these are one of the most important things that should have gone\r\nright the first time.\r\nI will ask Alberto to search for the instructions of the oven and also for\r\na set of new pots, also the other items will be brought to you soon.\r\n\r\nAt this moment I am not sure when I will be there, but I hope soon!\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\nOn Thu, 11 Jun 2026 at 17:48, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> Thanks for the concern, it wasn't really a problem just tiring.\r\n>\r\n> I'll wait to hear  from you when the payment mechanism is up and running\r\n> and will take care of it then.\r\n>\r\n> Regarding your new cleaning team, it was pretty good. The main room was\r\n> fine, and I appreciate you putting the mattress topper on the bed!  Thank\r\n> you.\r\n>\r\n> The kitchen was also clean, a little short on some supplies, like no dish\r\n> cloth to dry dishes and no dish cleaning liquid or tray for the dishes or\r\n> cutting board etc. those things are pretty standard so maybe they forgot to\r\n> put those things out.\r\n>\r\n> There is a frying pan and one very large saucepan, so I can't boil an egg\r\n> for example.  I bought a small saucepan this morning and a cutting board.\r\n> So that problem is solved, but things like an egg cup would be nice.\r\n>\r\n> As far as the bathroom, honestly that could be a little better.  There\r\n> were some long black hairs behind the toilet on the floor, which I know\r\n> can't be mine unfortunately, because my hair is short and grey....  Also a\r\n> few pubic hairs around the back of the toilet seat. So not perfect, but not\r\n> disastrous. Everything else was good.\r\n>\r\n> My only problem is how to use the oven.  In room 3 it was the same oven\r\n> but there were symbols around the knob so you could see the temperature and\r\n> grill function etc.  There are no signs or symbols on this one, so I have\r\n> no idea how to use it.  If you can explain it when we meet that would be\r\n> great.\r\n>\r\n> All the best\r\n>\r\n> Brand\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n> On Thursday, June 11th, 2026 at 6:52 AM, Short-Stay Inn <\r\n> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hi Brand,\r\n>\r\n> I’m sorry to hear about the difficult start to your trip, but I am glad\r\n> you managed to get some rest!\r\n>\r\n> Regarding the garbage authorization tag, we have changed the system and it\r\n> is no longer kept in the studio. You can find the card in the mailbox\r\n> downstairs. When you exit the building, the mailbox will be on your right;\r\n> it is unlocked, so you can pick up the card there. Please remember to\r\n> return it to the mailbox after use.\r\n>\r\n> As for the rent, the current system does not provide me with the CVC code,\r\n> so I will create a new payment link via Stripe. Please wait to make the\r\n> payment until I have updated the overview, which should be ready by\r\n> tomorrow.\r\n>\r\n> I was hoping to stop by today, but I am fully scheduled and my wife has\r\n> the car. Please let me know if you have any questions in the meantime.\r\n>\r\n> Lastly, I would appreciate any feedback on the studio's condition upon\r\n> arrival. We have new cleaning staff, and your input would be very helpful\r\n> for our training process.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n>\r\n> Sander\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Thu, 11 Jun 2026 at 10:03, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Hi Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> Everything went a bit wrong yesterday, the train strike meant I went a\r\n>> different route than the usual Amersfoort change, and so I ended up\r\n>> changing at Deventer, except no one told me so I ended up going way too far\r\n>> in the wrong direction.\r\n>>\r\n>> By the time I realized I had to change and go back for an hour before I\r\n>> could get back to Deventer, and by then my phone had died. Anyway, by the\r\n>> time I got here I think it was about 5 pm and my jet lag kicked in and I\r\n>> lay down and fell asleep!\r\n>>\r\n>> I will keep both phones live for a while an slowly switch. So, you can\r\n>> message me on either phone.\r\n>>\r\n>> I will try the rent payment again and make sure the svc code is on there.\r\n>> That should be an immediate payment.\r\n>>\r\n>> Also when you have a moment if you could drop off the garbage\r\n>> authorization tag that would be great, I didn't see it in the kitchen\r\n>> cupboard.\r\n>>\r\n>> Look forward to seeing you.\r\n>>\r\n>> Best\r\n>>\r\n>> Brand\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>> US phone: 1 (714) 955-2056\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>> On Thursday, June 11th, 2026 at 3:51 AM, Short-Stay Inn <\r\n>> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>> Hi Brand,\r\n>> How are you?\r\n>> I noticed my whatsapp messages did not arrive yesterday. Do you have\r\n>> another active number now that you are here in the Netherlands?\r\n>>\r\n>> See you soon!\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> On Wed, 10 Jun 2026 at 13:44, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n>> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>>> Good to know, I’ll sort it when I get there. Not sure about arrival time\r\n>>> but looks like a little before 3pm.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> If the room is not ready I’ll just leave my suitcase and go have a\r\n>>> coffee, if that all right.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Best\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Sent from Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> for iOS.\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> -------- Original Message --------\r\n>>> On Monday, 06/08/26 at 14:00 Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\n>>> wrote:\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Hi Brand,\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Good to hear from you. I just checked, but did not receive the payment,\r\n>>> I did however received the creditcard digits but not cvc number. But for me\r\n>>> it is totally fine to figure it out when you are in the Netherlands. So no\r\n>>> rush.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> If I am not mistaken you have received the check in details last night.\r\n>>> This is an automated message, did you receive it?\r\n>>>\r\n>>> See you soon!\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>>>\r\n>>> On Sat, 6 Jun 2026 at 18:14, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n>>> wrote:\r\n>>>\r\n>>>> Hi Sander\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> I made the first rent payment via the credit card option, using the\r\n>>>> portal you gave me. It seemed to go fine and I received a 'Thank You'\r\n>>>> notice, but I don't see it on my credit card yet.\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> Please let me know if you got it OK otherwise I'll just do it the way I\r\n>>>> did the last payment.\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> BTW which bell do I ring when I get to you?\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> Thanks see you soon\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> Regards\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n	2026-06-12 10:17:43+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19ebb566ddc969