>>\n>>> As for the rent, the current system does not provide me with the CVC code, so I will create a new payment link via Stripe. Please wait to make the payment until I have updated the overview, which should be ready by tomorrow.\n>>>\n>>> I was hoping to stop by today, but I am fully scheduled and my wife has the car. Please let me know if you have any questions in the meantime.\n>>>\n>>> Lastly, I would appreciate any feedback on the studio's condition upon arrival. We have new cleaning staff, and your input would be very helpful for our training process.\n>>>\n>>> Kind regards,\n>>>\n>>> Sander\n>>>\n>>> On Thu, 11 Jun 2026 at 10:03, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\n>>>\n>>>> Hi Sander\n>>>>\n>>>> Everything went a bit wrong yesterday, the train strike meant I went a different route than the usual Amersfoort change, and so I ended up changing at Deventer, except no one told me so I ended up going way too far in the wrong direction.\n>>>>\n>>>> By the time I realized I had to change and go back for an hour before I could get back to Deventer, and by then my phone had died. Anyway, by the time I got here I think it was about 5 pm and my jet lag kicked in and I lay down and fell asleep!\n>>>>\n>>>> I will keep both phones live for a while an slowly switch. So, you can message me on either phone.\n>>>>\n>>>> I will try the rent payment again and make sure the svc code is on there. That should be an immediate payment.\n>>>>\n>>>> Also when you have a moment if you could drop off the garbage authorization tag that would be great, I didn't see it in the kitchen cupboard.\n>>>>\n>>>> Look forward to seeing you.\n>>>>\n>>>> Best\n>>>>\n>>>> Brand\n>>>>\n>>>> Brand Scheffer\n>>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>>> US phone: 1 (714) 955-2056\n>>>>\n>>>> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n>>>>\n>>>> On Thursday, June 11th, 2026 at 3:51 AM, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n>>>>\n>>>>> Hi Brand,\n>>>>> How are you