17	8	gmail	19e4fcaed95c3386	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Introduction of your Location Manager	Dear Brand,\r\n\r\nThroughout the booking process, I have been your main contact for all questions. As my role mainly focuses on booking arrangements, it now comes to an end.\r\n\r\nAs a preparation for your arrival, and to make sure on-site matters are handled directly, I would like to introduce my colleague Alberto, the Location Manager of your booked accommodation. From this moment on, he will be your first point of contact for any questions.\r\n\r\nAlberto personally takes care of on-site matters such as check-in and check-out, as well as repairs, improvements, and maintenance. He speaks English, Spanish, German, Portuguese, and Dutch so you can easily reach out in the language that suits you best.\r\n\r\nYou can contact Alberto directly by phone or WhatsApp at +31 6 41722332, or by email at info@enschedayinn.com.\r\nFor many useful answers, you may also visit: https://notre.guide/EnscheDayInn\r\n\r\nFor any administrative purposes such as extensions, shortenings, invoices, or planning, you can still contact me directly. Of course, I will also remain active in the background, and Alberto and I will stay in close contact to ensure your questions or requests are answered quickly.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander Lock\r\nInfo@shorstayinn.com\r\n+31538200946	2026-05-22 13:05:59+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19e4fcaed95c3386", "threadId": "19e4fcaed95c3386", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Brand, Throughout the booking process, I have been your main contact for all questions. As my role mainly focuses on booking arrangements, it now comes to an end. As a preparation for your arrival", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Return-Path", "value": "<info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "from mail.xmlcal.com (mail.beds24.com. [188.34.132.40])        by smtp.gmail.com wit