70	28	gmail	1974028f2a88bbeb	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Where is the lightswitch...?	Hello Brand,\r\n\r\nThere is a round switch or in the kitchen closets on the inside left or\r\nright.\r\n\r\nOr it is placed under the kitchen closet, from the underside upwards.\r\n\r\nIf you like I can ask Alberto to come by and help out.\r\n\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\nOp do 5 jun 2025, 14:44 schreef brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com\r\n>:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> This is a pretty stupid question, but where is the lightswitch for the\r\n> under cabinet lighting in the kitchen?\r\n>\r\n> After the power cut this morning, when the electricity came back, the\r\n> lights were on unde the cabinets in the kitchen.  I have tried everything\r\n> to turn them off but can't find a switch that controls those lights.  Do\r\n> you know how to turn them off?\r\n>\r\n> Thanks!\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n	2025-06-05 12:55:14+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1974028f2a88bbeb", "threadId": "1973fe7c29c5f1a4", "labelIds": ["Label_4139206071984797100", "SENT"], "snippet": "Hello Brand, There is a round switch or in the kitchen closets on the inside left or right. Or it is placed under the kitchen closet, from the underside upwards. If you like I can ask Alberto to come", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Thu, 5 Jun 2025 15:55:14 +0300"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<vbfOetzrgFhXYLCzAAI0v055vnrbrklbHyWt4auD9ZbGnga1rBNAgDgKd-uEsNDMRLVyxLtAc0i9JGoqlQPz50mcVHy4xW5wjnpimS0XCAw=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<vbfOetzrgFhXYLCzAAI0v055vnrbrklbHyWt4auD9ZbGnga