30	14	gmail	19e2cbc0e7168660	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Return to NL	Hi Sander\n\nI'm finally heading back to NL! I will be back by the 9th of next month and looking for a place to stay.\n\nI am actually relocating and will register myself as resident again. Most likely I will look around the Den Bosch area for logistical reasons, but that means for the first couple of months I will need a place to stay.\n\nIf you have any availability do let me know and I'll be happy to see you again!\n\nKind regards\n\nBrand\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2026-05-15 17:42:56+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19e2cbc0e7168660", "threadId": "19e2cbc0e7168660", "labelIds": ["Label_1738314444454715560", "IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL", "INBOX"], "snippet": "Hi Sander I&#39;m finally heading back to NL! I will be back by the 9th of next month and looking for a place to stay. I am actually relocating and will register myself as resident again. Most likely I", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6a10:6f2c:b0:6d1:e48b:57e7 with SMTP id jd44csp468645pxb;        Fri, 15 May 2026 10:43:03 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "X-Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6512:1044:b0:5a8:fbe0:bc6d with SMTP id 2adb3069b0e04-5aa0e613414mr1745587e87.14.1778866982784;        Fri, 15 May 2026 10:43:02 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "ARC-Seal", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; t=1778866982; cv=none;        d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        b=Sq0YowNZlZEteeefQZfoaTN+kiiYy128Xintorppm7T3WRkaqbNX3HK3MrZ1OWqoj8         PWH/e6VTvSAsnt6K8/YdzAWuXpaUFA0S9iNLS/jnn0zITE4dV3mpBH0oqnv4neSGCkOe         4vpvsKz/FP5kNjCqX9YGuaZcw3eRtMbJdtInMIAy5MKNGyHtpyvzXrc+UZrzGLWhhrxv         uJMhUs6PYBBs17yGthLkpYwMrtTsuSRMI3OPv87OtiRYG7IBFBCrIP+EeBFwY3CFNRn+         1IwjB29wmaPHaTghRfEHYUmqFTlvhcQz