31	14	gmail	19e353899ba72247	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Return to NL	Hi Brand,\r\n\r\nGood to hear you are coming back to NL! That sounds like a big move.\r\nJust to make sure. 'Den Bosch' area is quite far from Enschede (2 hr by car\r\n3 hr by train).\r\nAre you sure you like to stay in Enschede in the beginning?\r\n\r\nFrom the 9th of June we have several options available at the moment:\r\n - Room 4 in Bilderdijkstraat (approx 300 m from where you stayed last\r\ntime) ; private double room and bathroom and airconditioning on 2nd floor\r\nbut kitchen en garden are shared\r\n - Room 5, same building and conditions but bigger and on the ground floor.\r\n - Studio 4 in same building as you stayed last time; double room at back\r\nside of building. Private bathroom and kitchen\r\n - Studio 6; same building but single room; also private bathroom and\r\nkitchen at the back side of the building.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have a preferance and I will make you a quotation.\r\n\r\nLook forward to hearing from you!\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander\r\n\r\nOn Fri, 15 May 2026 at 19:43, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> I'm finally heading back to NL!  I will be back by the 9th of next month\r\n> and looking for a place to stay.\r\n>\r\n> I am actually relocating and will register myself as resident again.  Most\r\n> likely I will look around the Den Bosch area for logistical reasons, but\r\n> that means for the first couple of months I will need a place to stay.\r\n>\r\n> If you have any availability do let me know and I'll be happy to see you\r\n> again!\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards\r\n>\r\n> Brand\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n	2026-05-17 09:16:01+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19e353899ba72247", "threadId": "19e2cbc0e7168660", "labelIds": ["Label_1738314444454715560", "SENT"], "snippet"