33	14	gmail	19e40ada0529b2ba	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Return to NL	Hi Brand,\r\n\r\nSounds like a good plan to check Enschede first, you are right about the\r\nvalue for money here.\r\nStudio 4 seems like the best fit based on your preference: private kitchen\r\nand bathroom, and at the back of the building. Because studio 4 became also\r\nthe only fit in the mean time. I got a few bookings last days. So I have\r\nblocked it now directly for you to make sure it is available. I have\r\nblocked it now till the 10th of August, just as a start.\r\n\r\nOn exactly your day of arrival is also the check out of the previous\r\ntennant. We need a cleaning window of approx 2 hours, would it be okay for\r\nyou if the check in is from 15:00?\r\n\r\nAt this moment I am a little bit in a time rush, I have to pick up the boys\r\nfrom school, is it okay i will send tomorrow the quotation? atleast it is\r\nnow blocked so not stress.\r\nThanks for understanding!\r\n\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\nOn Tue, 19 May 2026 at 15:46, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> Thanks for the message and the text. I was looking at some of the options\r\n> before proceeding.  It's always tricky to arrange these things from\r\n> overseas.\r\n>\r\n> Den Bosch is more convenient for me, but the prices are also higher.  I'm\r\n> thinking that maybe I should look around Enschede for an apartment. From\r\n> what I can see, I definitely get more for my money than I would in Den\r\n> Bosch, so I think to start with I will come back to you, and then make a\r\n> decision when I am there.\r\n>\r\n> I want a room with a kitchen and bathroom and probably prefer to be at the\r\n> back than the front, that room got seriously hot last year! So, if if you\r\n> can suggest a couple of options for 2 months that would be great.\r\n>\r\n> I will simply transfer funds to you like last time if that works for you.\r\n> I arrive back in NL on the 9th of June, but its really early in the\r\n> morning, so I will stay in a hotel at the airport and then make my way to\r\n> you on the 10, arriving around 12 midday.\r\n>\r\n> Look forward to hearing from you and coming back to the Short Stay Inn!\r\n>\r\n> Best\r\n>\r\n> Brand\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n> On Sunday, May 17th, 2026 at 5:16 AM, Short-Stay Inn <\r\n> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hi Brand,\r\n>\r\n> Good to hear you are coming back to NL! That sounds like a big move.\r\n> Just to make sure. 'Den Bosch' area is quite far from Enschede (2 hr by\r\n> car 3 hr by train).\r\n> Are you sure you like to stay in Enschede in the beginning?\r\n>\r\n> From the 9th of June we have several options available at the moment:\r\n> - Room 4 in Bilderdijkstraat (approx 300 m from where you stayed last\r\n> time) ; private double room and bathroom and airconditioning on 2nd floor\r\n> but kitchen en garden are shared\r\n> - Room 5, same building and conditions but bigger and on the ground floor.\r\n> - Studio 4 in same building as you stayed last time; double room at back\r\n> side of building. Private bathroom and kitchen\r\n> - Studio 6; same building but single room; also private bathroom and\r\n> kitchen at the back side of the building.\r\n>\r\n> Please let me know if you have a preferance and I will make you a\r\n> quotation.\r\n>\r\n> Look forward to hearing from you!\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n> Sander\r\n>\r\n> On Fri, 15 May 2026 at 19:43, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Hi Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> I'm finally heading back to NL! I will be back by the 9th of next month\r\n>> and looking for a place to stay.\r\n>>\r\n>> I am actually relocating and will register myself as resident again. Most\r\n>> likely I will look around the Den Bosch area for logistical reasons, but\r\n>> that means for the first couple of months I will need a place to stay.\r\n>>\r\n>> If you have any availability do let me know and I'll be happy to see you\r\n>> again!\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards\r\n>>\r\n>> Brand\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n	2026-05-19 14:39:41+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19e40ada0529b2ba", "threadId": "19e2cbc0e7168660", "labelIds": ["Label_1738314444454715560", "SENT"], "snippet": "Hi Brand, Sounds like a good plan to check Enschede first, you are right about the value for money here. Studio 4 seems like the best fit based on your preference: private kitchen and bathroom, and at", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Tue, 19 May 2026 16:39:41 +0200"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<e2sC6pJpxurtVqwSwXn1gCtfY0xqTS0a_-o1aoM0-uoE2TcwE5uX9Xc0hRqhApMrQpUwtkX2nkUP6fVkay_jRdpDgRVNuH4QD2zALEhXFKk=@protonmail.com> <CAHrPiLj5V6s0x_==d7mppfBwg2eVeYcypT6tXa4diTD6zwFqXQ@mail.gmail.com> <9aAYr3EBt274nu0264hiAm2Is40DNRFSLwyiflwdTB3gH5ViWvaB5qZ4fz4TKTs9Txq3TsyGMiYv-4ZcyHfAMBz2OTLiJBrvlcl24DpebTA=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<9aAYr3EBt274nu0264hiAm2Is40DNRFSLwyiflwdTB3gH5ViWvaB5qZ4fz4TKTs9Txq3TsyGMiYv-4ZcyHfAMBz2OTLiJBrvlcl24DpebTA=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAHrPiLhk+8ci6iZM_NLu2DOJRTU5C2bqTyq_Gvq0M8O5=sidVw@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: Return to NL"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\\"0000000000003e9df506522ca6ff\\""}], "body": {"size": 0}, "parts": [{"partId": "0", "mimeType": "text/plain", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}], "b