43	15	gmail	19b9d0e4b4ebbba1	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: availability	Hi Brand,\r\nI just saw that I have created a quotation based on the start of 10th of\r\nJanuary instead of the 12th. If you like to continue renting I will update\r\nit directly so it is all correct in the administration.\r\n\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 19:51, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Brand,\r\n>\r\n> Good to hear from you, hope all goes well! Curacao, that sounds much more\r\n> warm then here in the Netherlands, the last few days the whole society has\r\n> stopped working because of the snow!\r\n> I have a single room in the same building available if you like; private\r\n> bathroom and kitchen. This room is at the back of the building, looking\r\n> over the park and less sound from traffic.\r\n>\r\n> The prices went up this year due the VAT increase from 9% to 21% and also\r\n> the citytax.\r\n> Now I added an extra discount so at least these increases are more\r\n> than compensated, you can find the details in the attached PDF.\r\n>\r\n> In the PDF you can find the link to the particular studio and\r\n> its description.\r\n> I look forward to welcoming you back!\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n> Sander\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n>\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 18:15, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Hi Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> I am in Curacao at the moment but may have to go back to NL in the near\r\n>> future.  Do you have any availability for a 10 week stay?\r\n>>\r\n>> I don't need the same room, but anything with a comfortable bed and a\r\n>> place to cook will do.  I would probably need to find something for me\r\n>> arriving around the 12th of this month.\r\n>>\r\n>> Thanks!\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n	2026-01-08 10:01:57+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19b9d0e4b4ebbba1", "threadId": "19b99752464b9b0c", "labelIds": ["Label_6294885332966435177", "SENT"], "snippet": "Hi Brand, I just saw that I have created a quotation based on the start of 10th of January instead of the 12th. If you like to continue renting I will update it directly so it is all correct in the", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Thu, 8 Jan 2026 11:01:57 +0100"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<UuBo03WZl35v6k0u3s8sbRQXE0XBR4HRorUTjA5d8egwmLWkE3qzHfd0FmzpNgiS064PFHIjcu_fG1jMarZwtCS-ta_gqdemDE8qy3KssbM=@protonmail.com> <CAHrPiLgZ2uTANFhU3MvEzzjYCfosOuCJFMniLTuymNienRs5VA@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<CAHrPiLgZ2uTANFhU3MvEzzjYCfosOuCJFMniLTuymNienRs5VA@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAHrPiLg2Lbj_k3rOUbegGvF5jSvQdeM+Q-gR31JV+v9YkT4ktA@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: availability"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\\"000000000000d4e8f40647dd7f9c\\""}], "body": {"size": 0}, "parts": [{"partId": "0", "mimeType": "text/plain", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}], "body": {"size": 1988, "data": "-DQo-IEdvb2QgdG8gaGVhciBmcm9tIHlvdSwgaG9wZSBhbGwgZ29lcyB3ZWxsISBDdXJhY2FvLCB0aGF0IHNvdW5kcyBtdWNoIG1vcmUNCj4gd2FybSB0aGVuIGhlcmUgaW4gdGhlIE5ldGhlcmxhbmRzLCB0aGUgbGFzdCBmZXcgZGF5cyB0aGUgd2hvbGUgc29jaWV0eSBoYXMNCj4gc3RvcHBlZCB3b3JraW5nIGJlY2F1c2Ugb2YgdGhlIHNub3chDQo--IHRoYW4g