44	15	gmail	19b9d7ddaa5b00c9	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Re: availability	Hi Sander, thanks. I'm just trying to finalize dates and timing with colleagues and will let you know as soon as I can.\n\nBTW its 29 degrees here, actually too hot for my tastes.\n\nWill contact you soon\n\nBest\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n\nOn Thursday, 8 January 2026 at 05:02, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n\n> Hi Brand,\n> I just saw that I have created a quotation based on the start of 10th of January instead of the 12th. If you like to continue renting I will update it directly so it is all correct in the administration.\n>\n> Kind regards, Sander\n>\n> Short-Stay Inn\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK EnschedeThe Netherlands\n>\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\n>\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\n>\n> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 19:51, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n>\n>> Hi Brand,\n>>\n>> Good to hear from you, hope all goes well! Curacao, that sounds much more warm then here in the Netherlands, the last few days the whole society has stopped working because of the snow!\n>> I have a single room in the same building available if you like; private bathroom and kitchen. This room is at the back of the building, looking over the park and less sound from traffic.\n>>\n>> The prices went up this year due the VAT increase from 9% to 21% and also the citytax.\n>> Now I added an extra discount so at least these increases are more than compensated, you can find the details in the attached PDF.\n>>\n>> In the PDF you can find the link to the particular studio and its description.\n>> I look forward to welcoming you back!\n>>\n>> Kind regards,\n>> Sander\n>>\n>> Short-Stay Inn\n>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK EnschedeThe Netherlands\n>>\n>> www.ShortStayInn.com\n>>\n>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\n>>\n>> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 18:15, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\n>>\n>>> Hi Sander\n>>>\n>>> I am in Curacao at the moment but may have to go back to NL in the near future. Do you have any availability for a 10 week stay?\n>>>\n>>> I don't need the same room, but anything with a comfortable bed and a place to cook will do. I would probably need to find something for me arriving around the 12th of this month.\n>>>\n>>> Thanks!\n>>>\n>>> Brand Scheffer\n>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>>\n>>> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2026-01-08 12:03:42+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19b9d7ddaa5b00c9", "threadId": "19b99752464b9b0c", "labelIds": ["Label_6294885332966435177", "IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL", "INBOX"], "snippet": "Hi Sander, thanks. I&#39;m just trying to finalize dates and timing with colleagues and will let you know as soon as I can. BTW its 29 degrees here, actually too hot for my tastes. Will contact you", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:7301:5804:b0:2a6:a920:d654 with SMTP id jq4csp210081dyc;        Thu, 8 Jan 2026 04:03:49 -0800 (PST)"}, {"name": "X-Google-Smtp-Source", "value": "AGHT+IHkS0MMRAnoW++mEDiMGvqmSSICLl9OCXh10OGk6p/hIpA7KMOLlqhRa/mOTMV4ueq6iMVs"}, {"name": "X-Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6512:39cf:b0:59a:1bdf:c437 with SMTP id 2adb3069b0e04-59b6ef094bdmr2207346e87.11.1767873829414;        Thu, 08 Jan 2026 04:03:49 -0800 (PST)"}, {"name": "ARC-Seal", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; t=1767873829; cv=none;        d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        b=ST5vXXc4Xch1HUvPQuFbEUmDrnlBaih7NvOqekVJTcHr97r7Q5loRbh4yP3qfbZeuS         YXeMUIq9v2DZoveim0Yoax1ULpUlBQJ3UaRjRAg1//zdUBu/nsA0PndcqEAXJpM6nS3A         uAUzsqtKLTimffelpwcOnpkIBdkp+R9J1IQ+f0mYWhDfxZYWcZGh7LxUGWCIoYD/FaCA         IjIDMg7/xlD3Cqcm+iQ/TChtKsQ9Pc6zeCTOmflh+bhXDNa0uUBP0ZSgJzgWcApAr1vI         jndYq636/UVFsAcgMw1cmyt6gvdBfdI/F+LNuQ8aUnq2BPxZavTFC+YGB1ooJg6mtY2Q       