45	15	gmail	19baa6eb6236e70c	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Re: availability	Hi Sander\n\nIt turns out I can't leave right now after all. The colleague I was covering for won't be back for a while and we have had to re-arrange our travel schedules again. Apologies for the confusion.\n\nIt looks like I wont be coming to NL until next month. When dates and times are confirmed I'll drop you a line and see what your availability is.\n\nThanks for the prompt response and hope to be there soon.\n\nKind regards\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n\nOn Thursday, 8 January 2026 at 07:03, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\n\n> Hi Sander, thanks. I'm just trying to finalize dates and timing with colleagues and will let you know as soon as I can.\n>\n> BTW its 29 degrees here, actually too hot for my tastes.\n>\n> Will contact you soon\n>\n> Best\n>\n> Brand Scheffer\n> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>\n> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n>\n> On Thursday, 8 January 2026 at 05:02, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n>\n>> Hi Brand,\n>> I just saw that I have created a quotation based on the start of 10th of January instead of the 12th. If you like to continue renting I will update it directly so it is all correct in the administration.\n>>\n>> Kind regards, Sander\n>>\n>> Short-Stay Inn\n>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK EnschedeThe Netherlands\n>>\n>> www.ShortStayInn.com\n>>\n>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\n>>\n>> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 19:51, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n>>\n>>> Hi Brand,\n>>>\n>>> Good to hear from you, hope all goes well! Curacao, that sounds much more warm then here in the Netherlands, the last few days the whole society has stopped working because of the snow!\n>>> I have a single room in the same building available if you like; private bathroom and kitchen. This room is at the back of the building, looking over the park and less sound from traffic.\n>>>\n>>> The prices went up this year due the VAT increase from 9% to 21% and also the citytax.\n>>> Now I added an extra discount so at least these increases are more than compensated, you can find the details in the attached PDF.\n>>>\n>>> In the PDF you can find the link to the particular studio and its description.\n>>> I look forward to welcoming you back!\n>>>\n>>> Kind regards,\n>>> Sander\n>>>\n>>> Short-Stay Inn\n>>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK EnschedeThe Netherlands\n>>>\n>>> www.ShortStayInn.com\n>>>\n>>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\n>>>\n>>> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 18:15, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\n>>>\n>>>> Hi Sander\n>>>>\n>>>> I am in Curacao at the moment but may have to go back to NL in the near future. Do you have any availability for a 10 week stay?\n>>>>\n>>>> I don't need the same room, but anything with a comfortable bed and a place to cook will do. I would probably need to find something for me arriving around the 12th of this month.\n>>>>\n>>>> Thanks!\n>>>>\n>>>> Brand Scheffer\n>>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>>>\n>>>> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2026-01-11 00:22:18+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19baa6eb6236e70c", "threadId": "19b99752464b9b0c", "labelIds": ["Label_6294885332966435177", "IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL", "INBOX"], "snippet": "Hi Sander It turns out I can&#39;t leave right now after all. The colleague I was covering for won&#39;t be back for a while and we have had to re-arrange our travel schedules again. Apologies for the", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:7301:5804:b0:2a6:a920:d654 with SMTP id jq4csp1884788dyc;        Sat, 10 Jan 2026 16:22:21 -0800 (PST)"}, {"name": "X-Google-Smtp-Source", "value": "AGHT+IG2oao74h7XVnIU7W80nh7sanKKsiuIV3iWX4Z1VRn1PqL