46	15	gmail	19bad2f72cd480ca	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: availability	Hi Brand,\r\n\r\nThank you for the update, no problem at all ofcourse!\r\n\r\nJust let me know when you have a new schedule and we will find the best\r\nsolution for that moment.\r\n\r\nGood luck with the 29 degrees, we are now going for a small hike in the\r\nsnow ;-)\r\n\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Sun, 11 Jan 2026 at 01:22, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> It turns out I can't leave right now after all.  The colleague I was\r\n> covering for won't be back for a while and we have had to re-arrange our\r\n> travel schedules again. Apologies for the confusion.\r\n>\r\n> It looks like I wont be coming to NL until next month.  When dates and\r\n> times are confirmed I'll drop you a line and see what your availability is.\r\n>\r\n> Thanks for the prompt response and hope to be there soon.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n> On Thursday, 8 January 2026 at 07:03, brandscheffer <\r\n> brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hi Sander, thanks. I'm just trying to finalize dates and timing with\r\n> colleagues and will let you know as soon as I can.\r\n>\r\n> BTW its 29 degrees here, actually too hot for my tastes.\r\n>\r\n> Will contact you soon\r\n>\r\n> Best\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n> On Thursday, 8 January 2026 at 05:02, Short-Stay Inn <\r\n> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hi Brand,\r\n> I just saw that I have created a quotation based on the start of 10th of\r\n> January instead of the 12th. If you like to continue renting I will update\r\n> it directly so it is all correct in the administration.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n>\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 19:51, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Hi Brand,\r\n>>\r\n>> Good to hear from you, hope all goes well! Curacao, that sounds much more\r\n>> warm then here in the Netherlands, the last few days the whole society has\r\n>> stopped working because of the snow!\r\n>> I have a single room in the same building available if you like; private\r\n>> bathroom and kitchen. This room is at the back of the building, looking\r\n>> over the park and less sound from traffic.\r\n>>\r\n>> The prices went up this year due the VAT increase from 9% to 21% and also\r\n>> the citytax.\r\n>> Now I added an extra discount so at least these increases are more than\r\n>> compensated, you can find the details in the attached PDF.\r\n>>\r\n>> In the PDF you can find the link to the particular studio and its\r\n>> description.\r\n>> I look forward to welcoming you back!\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards,\r\n>> Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> Short-Stay Inn\r\n>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n>> The Netherlands\r\n>>\r\n>> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>>\r\n>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 18:15, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n>> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>>> Hi Sander\r\n>>>\r\n>>> I am in Curacao at the moment but may have to go back to NL in the near\r\n>>> future. Do you have any availability for a 10 week stay?\r\n>>>\r\n>>> I don't need the same room, but anything with a comfortable bed and a\r\n>>> place to cook will do. I would probably need to find something for me\r\n>>> arriving around the 12th of this month.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Thanks!\r\n>>>\r\n>>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>>\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n	2026-01-11 13:12:06+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19bad2f72cd480ca", "threadId": "19b99752464b9b0c", "labelIds": ["Label_6294885332966435177", "SENT"], "snippet": "Hi Brand, Thank you for the update, no problem at all ofcourse! Just let me know when you have a new schedule and we will find the best solution for that moment. Good luck with the 29 degrees, we are", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Sun, 11 Jan 2026 14:12:06 +0100"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<UuBo03WZl35v6k0u3s8sbRQXE0XBR4HRorUTjA5d8egwmLWkE3qzHfd0FmzpNgiS064PFHIjcu_fG1jMarZwtCS-ta_gqdemDE8qy3KssbM=@protonmail.com> <CAHrPiLgZ2uTANFhU3MvEzzjYCfosOuCJFMniLTuymNienRs5VA@mail.gmail.com> <CAHrPiLg2Lbj_k3rOUbegGvF5jSvQdeM+Q-gR31JV+v9YkT4ktA@mail.gmail.com> <-aZtAU-o5mzCSYCRsdYGKTCIJOzAV8fFNyL7kvtSRpOiWUS1ebczkQhHGRmY_-PLkdK7gWaA9NptYg6zWcvRrFGiN4jZRM0b9Uov0N3SCmc=@protonmail.com> <Hm1x8VtIDFs99bf1Z8lnKcaq4fkNrpjs-3mlmctwGCnjbzG66jAPm3QsKfZaDYGYu3EEbI4N1LXbsyH_g54c5VgqJtSmj02o0kQjY82i9GU=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<Hm1x8VtIDFs99bf1Z8lnKcaq4fkNrpjs-3mlmctwGCnjbzG66jAPm3QsKfZaDYGYu3EEbI4N1LXbsyH_g54c5VgqJtSmj02o0kQjY82i9GU=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAHrPiLhc3+hbAHTaqoMi=TmhXb_HjRTb1sy7TKh-dDC2PVRLWw@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: availability"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\\"0000000000005b282506481c8108\\""}], "body": {"size": 0}, "parts": [{"partId": "0", "mimeType": "text/plain", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}], "body": {"size": 3706, "data": "-DQp3cm90ZToNCg0KPiBIaSBTYW5kZXINCj4NCj