47	15	gmail	19bd6f9faed27f30	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: availability	Hi Brand,\r\n\r\nhave you seen my texts last week via Whatsapp with the pictures?\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\n======\r\nHi Brand,\r\nis it possible that we have mail for you from the insurance company\r\n"Zilveren kruis". it is on the name S. instead of B. Scheffer.\r\nwe have 2 envelopes, but I don't know how old it is, it can be from end Nov\r\nor beginning Dec.\r\nPlease let me know what to do with it.\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\n======\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Sun, 11 Jan 2026 at 14:12, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Brand,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you for the update, no problem at all ofcourse!\r\n>\r\n> Just let me know when you have a new schedule and we will find the best\r\n> solution for that moment.\r\n>\r\n> Good luck with the 29 degrees, we are now going for a small hike in the\r\n> snow ;-)\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n>\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Sun, 11 Jan 2026 at 01:22, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Hi Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> It turns out I can't leave right now after all.  The colleague I was\r\n>> covering for won't be back for a while and we have had to re-arrange our\r\n>> travel schedules again. Apologies for the confusion.\r\n>>\r\n>> It looks like I wont be coming to NL until next month.  When dates and\r\n>> times are confirmed I'll drop you a line and see what your availability is.\r\n>>\r\n>> Thanks for the prompt response and hope to be there soon.\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>> On Thursday, 8 January 2026 at 07:03, brandscheffer <\r\n>> brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>> Hi Sander, thanks. I'm just trying to finalize dates and timing with\r\n>> colleagues and will let you know as soon as I can.\r\n>>\r\n>> BTW its 29 degrees here, actually too hot for my tastes.\r\n>>\r\n>> Will contact you soon\r\n>>\r\n>> Best\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>> On Thursday, 8 January 2026 at 05:02, Short-Stay Inn <\r\n>> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>> Hi Brand,\r\n>> I just saw that I have created a quotation based on the start of 10th of\r\n>> January instead of the 12th. If you like to continue renting I will update\r\n>> it directly so it is all correct in the administration.\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> Short-Stay Inn\r\n>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n>> The Netherlands\r\n>>\r\n>> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>>\r\n>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 19:51, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\n>> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>>> Hi Brand,\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Good to hear from you, hope all goes well! Curacao, that sounds much\r\n>>> more warm then here in the Netherlands, the last few days the whole society\r\n>>> has stopped working because of the snow!\r\n>>> I have a single room in the same building available if you like; private\r\n>>> bathroom and kitchen. This room is at the back of the building, looking\r\n>>> over the park and less sound from traffic.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> The prices went up this year due the VAT increase from 9% to 21% and\r\n>>> also the citytax.\r\n>>> Now I added an extra discount so at least these increases are more than\r\n>>> compensated, you can find the details in the attached PDF.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> In the PDF you can find the link to the particular studio and its\r\n>>> description.\r\n>>> I look forward to welcoming you back!\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Kind regards,\r\n>>> Sander\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Short-Stay Inn\r\n>>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n>>> The Netherlands\r\n>>>\r\n>>> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> On Wed, 7 Jan 2026 at 18:15, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n>>> wrote:\r\n>>>\r\n>>>> Hi Sander\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> I am in Curacao at the moment but may have to go back to NL in the near\r\n>>>> future. Do you have any availability for a 10 week stay?\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> I don't need the same room, but anything with a comfortable bed and a\r\n>>>> place to cook will do. I would probably need to find something for me\r\n>>>> arriving around the 12th of this month.\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> Thanks!\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n	2026-01-19 15:57:43+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19bd6f9faed27f30", "threadId": "19b99752464b9b0c", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Hi Brand, have you seen my texts last week via Whatsapp with the pictures? Kind regards, Sander ====== Hi Brand, is it possible that we have mail for you from the insurance company &quot;Zilveren kruis", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Mon, 19 Jan 2026 16:57:43 +0100"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<UuBo03WZl35v6k0u3s8sbRQXE0XBR4HRorUTjA5d8egwmLWkE3qzHfd0FmzpNgiS064PFHIjcu_fG1jMarZwtCS-ta_gqdemDE8qy3KssbM=@protonmail.com> <CAHrPiLgZ2uTANFhU3MvEzzjYCfosOuCJFMniLTuymNienRs5VA@mail.gmail.com> <CAHrPiLg2Lbj_k3rOUbegGvF5jSvQdeM+Q-gR31JV+v9YkT4ktA@mail.gmail.com> <-aZtAU-o5mzCSYCRsdYGKTCIJOzAV8fFNyL7kvtSRpOiWUS1ebczkQhHGRmY_-PLkdK7gWaA9NptYg6zWcvRrFGiN4jZRM0b9Uov0N3SCmc=@protonmail.com> <Hm1x8VtIDFs99bf1Z8lnKcaq4fkNrpjs-3mlmctwGCnjbzG66jAPm3QsKfZaDYGYu3EEbI4N1LXbsyH_g54c5VgqJtSmj02o0kQjY82i9GU=@pr