51	18	gmail	1998b54c1191810b	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Complaints of usage of washing machine.	Dear Brand Scheffer,\r\nWe would like to kindly inform you that the washing machine was used last night outside the allowed hours. Unfortunately, this had a significant impact on the night’s rest of other guests, for which we are truly sorry.Please note that the washing machines may only be used between 09:00 and 21:00. Outside these times, other guests have the right to switch the machines off. In addition, between 12:00 and 15:00 the machines are reserved for use by our cleaning staff.You can also find these guidelines in our digital leaflet: [https://notre.guide/CentralDayInn/en#services_laundry].Thank you very much for your understanding and cooperation.Kind regards,Alberto\r\nLocation Manager	2025-09-27 13:20:10+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1998b54c1191810b", "threadId": "1998b54c1191810b", "labelIds": ["Label_4139206071984797100", "SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Brand Scheffer, We would like to kindly inform you that the washing machine was used last night outside the allowed hours. Unfortunately, this had a significant impact on the night&#39;s rest of", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Return-Path", "value": "<info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "from mail.xmlcal.com (mail.beds24.com. [188.34.132.40])        by smtp.gmail.com with ESMTPSA id ffacd0b85a97d-40fb72face8sm10983095f8f.5.2025.09.27.06.20.11        for <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>        (version=TLS1_3 cipher=TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 bits=256/256);        Sat, 27 Sep 2025 06:20:11 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Sat, 27 Sep 2025 13:20:10 +0000"}, {"name": "Return-Path", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Reply-To", "value": "info@enschedayinn.nl"}, {"name": "To", "value