52	19	gmail	1997aeaaabe97fbf	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Departure Date	Hi Sander\n\nI just wanted to let you know that I will be departing this coming Sunday the 28th at around 12 midday.\n\nI'll make sure the place is clean and ready for your team to put finishing touches in place, ready for the next guest. I assume the deposit will be wired back to the same bank I sent it from, following my departure?\n\nIt's been a very useful stay for me and I've appreciated your attentiveness.\n\nWishing you all the best for the future.\n\nKind regards\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2025-09-24 08:50:11+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1997aeaaabe97fbf", "threadId": "1997aeaaabe97fbf", "labelIds": ["IMPORTANT", "Label_4139206071984797100", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"], "snippet": "Hi Sander I just wanted to let you know that I will be departing this coming Sunday the 28th at around 12 midday. I&#39;ll make sure the place is clean and ready for your team to put finishing touches", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:7301:3d11:b0:229:1563:ed2a with SMTP id oe17csp1352534dyb;        Wed, 24 Sep 2025 01:50:23 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "X-Google-Smtp-Source", "value": "AGHT+IFo9XnfgPIxg7/SFPUoXPPq7uPNA+9tV+9G4il7huY5g2wpldH0qc2w+MvOupjNU9rFtOVe"}, {"name": "X-Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6512:3da0:b0:570:8bc4:9549 with SMTP id 2adb3069b0e04-580725f63f2mr1708683e87.27.1758703823669;        Wed, 24 Sep 2025 01:50:23 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "ARC-Seal", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; t=1758703823; cv=none;        d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        b=iPlDPUo5+vw76N4l3p/gAteBIabFZ3+o7ZSg9bNtvu5u14eAzqUuEg623tPqKSE2Gn         4djz6rzJWjIp5QMtLQtBLDqY9uhkzLHmBB/PrcNcPQO9DOObgkV3WUxkeUYbNlvVhbHT         lzA7xd6Wyyf9B/adEh0wWEcW24jFbWbm0Zblvd9Jk