53	19	gmail	1997caea8611c6ee	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Departure Date	Dear Brand,\r\n\r\nI am very happy to hear that we were able to offer a good place for you.\r\nHopefully you were able to finish all the things that you had to do.\r\n\r\nWe will transfer the deposit back to your account just after the check out.\r\nYou can leave the key on the table in the room.\r\n\r\nHopefully we will meet again and thanks for taking care of the place during\r\nyour stay!\r\n\r\nI wish you all the best as well and have a safe travel!\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Wed, 24 Sept 2025 at 10:50, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> I just wanted to let you know that I will be departing this coming Sunday\r\n> the 28th at around 12 midday.\r\n>\r\n> I'll make sure the place is clean and ready for your team to put finishing\r\n> touches in place, ready for the next guest.  I assume the deposit will be\r\n> wired back to the same bank I sent it from, following my departure?\r\n>\r\n> It's been a very useful stay for me and I've appreciated your\r\n> attentiveness.\r\n>\r\n> Wishing you all the best for the future.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n	2025-09-24 17:04:03+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1997caea8611c6ee", "threadId": "1997aeaaabe97fbf", "labelIds": ["Label_4139206071984797100", "SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Brand, I am very happy to hear that we were able to offer a good place for you. Hopefully you were able to finish all the things that you had to do. We will transfer the deposit back to your", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "valu