69	28	gmail	1973fe7c29c5f1a4	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Where is the lightswitch...?	Hi Sander\n\nThis is a pretty stupid question, but where is the lightswitch for the under cabinet lighting in the kitchen?\n\nAfter the power cut this morning, when the electricity came back, the lights were on unde the cabinets in the kitchen. I have tried everything to turn them off but can't find a switch that controls those lights. Do you know how to turn them off?\n\nThanks!\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2025-06-05 11:43:58+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1973fe7c29c5f1a4", "threadId": "1973fe7c29c5f1a4", "labelIds": ["IMPORTANT", "Label_4139206071984797100", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"], "snippet": "Hi Sander This is a pretty stupid question, but where is the lightswitch for the under cabinet lighting in the kitchen? After the power cut this morning, when the electricity came back, the lights were", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:7300:1354:b0:175:1b2a:c616 with SMTP id f20csp163237dyg;        Thu, 5 Jun 2025 04:44:03 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "X-Google-Smtp-Source", "value": "AGHT+IGDGqANJDGLTLEnU9WvtBnM+K84Eq//70oRLBIQj2za424U9xcX+988C+FeJzVLbIz1JrQW"}, {"name": "X-Received", "value": "by 2002:adf:ef06:0:b0:3a5:298a:3214 with SMTP id ffacd0b85a97d-3a5298a37bfmr1459447f8f.13.1749123842978;        Thu, 05 Jun 2025 04:44:02 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "ARC-Seal", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; t=1749123842; cv=none;        d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        b=beONnEjO5H4K8WROXbKxmlQ3uPgU/o2q0QaZbwXvG4gK/lMw+tr0olnFZzKCOubynM         WK94EpdT9wsCQ5dxpRrOvl2xUmC/SISAo9bWKX6APLLqs5+VGjALGEPYCVzLo/ajjPFl         NkhJwTdjfNWokDHSJkpI+TtJ3bRNrGzEUj/7BR47OC/ZS1XGttQ4jKvYpm1ZqCefUe4g         Bgjq4S4EkpDX4Ec/rgnPZNahQ6JVdyOzNtt8KzZuZKpAlJRP