71	28	gmail	197402da28e25fdc	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Re: Where is the lightswitch...?	Got it, I thought that was a smoke alarm. Thank you!\n\nKind regards\n\nBrand\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n\nOn Thursday, 5 June 2025 at 14:55, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n\n> Hello Brand,\n>\n> There is a round switch or in the kitchen closets on the inside left or right.\n>\n> Or it is placed under the kitchen closet, from the underside upwards.\n>\n> If you like I can ask Alberto to come by and help out.\n>\n> Kind regards, Sander\n>\n> Short-Stay Inn\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK EnschedeThe Netherlands\n>\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\n>\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\n>\n> Op do 5 jun 2025, 14:44 schreef brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>:\n>\n>> Hi Sander\n>>\n>> This is a pretty stupid question, but where is the lightswitch for the under cabinet lighting in the kitchen?\n>>\n>> After the power cut this morning, when the electricity came back, the lights were on unde the cabinets in the kitchen. I have tried everything to turn them off but can't find a switch that controls those lights. Do you know how to turn them off?\n>>\n>> Thanks!\n>>\n>> Brand Scheffer\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>\n>> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2025-06-05 13:00:15+00	{"gmail": {"id": "197402da28e25fdc", "threadId": "1973fe7c29c5f1a4", "labelIds": ["IMPORTANT", "Label_4139206071984797100", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"], "snippet": "Got it, I thought that was a smoke alarm. Thank you! Kind regards Brand Brand Scheffer Direct: +356 7903 4134 Sent with Proton Mail secure email. On Thursday, 5 June 2025 at 14:55, Short-Stay Inn &lt;", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:7300:1354:b0: