72	28	gmail	1975a5f4f21db27b	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Where is the lightswitch...?	Hello Brand,\r\n\r\nI ordered the topper once again and according to the website should arrive\r\nthis week.\r\n\r\nAre you okay if I received it that me or Alberto can place it? then we will\r\nask the cleaning staff directly to replace the sheets as well.\r\n\r\nKind regards, Sander\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Thu, 5 Jun 2025 at 15:00, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Got it, I thought that was a smoke alarm.  Thank you!\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards\r\n>\r\n> Brand\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n> On Thursday, 5 June 2025 at 14:55, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hello Brand,\r\n>\r\n> There is a round switch or in the kitchen closets on the inside left or\r\n> right.\r\n>\r\n> Or it is placed under the kitchen closet, from the underside upwards.\r\n>\r\n> If you like I can ask Alberto to come by and help out.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n>\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>\r\n> Op do 5 jun 2025, 14:44 schreef brandscheffer <\r\n> brandscheffer@protonmail.com>:\r\n>\r\n>> Hi Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> This is a pretty stupid question, but where is the lightswitch for the\r\n>> under cabinet lighting in the kitchen?\r\n>>\r\n>> After the power cut this morning, when the electricity came back, the\r\n>> lights were on unde the cabinets in the kitchen. I have tried everything to\r\n>> turn them off but can't find a switch that controls those lights. Do you\r\n>> know how to turn them off?\r\n>>\r\n>> Thanks!\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n	2025-06-10 15:04:44+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1975a5f4f21db27b", "threadId": "1973fe7c29c5f1a4", "labelIds": ["Label_4139206071984797100", "SENT"], "snippet": "Hello Brand, I ordered the topper once again and according to the website should arrive this week. Are you okay if I received it that me or Alberto can place it? then we will ask the cleaning staff", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Tue, 10 Jun 2025 17:04:44 +0200"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<vbfOetzrgFhXYLCzAAI0v055vnrbrklbHyWt4auD9ZbGnga1rBNAgDgKd-uEsNDMRLVyxLtAc0i9JGoqlQPz50mcVHy4xW5wjnpimS0XCAw=@protonmail.com> <CAHrPiLgvXmBJBwByqMoDaX-QqEA27OF76OL42mLdWCs5PDaY7w@mail.gmail.com> <WmMVVo-4y-FJFwOjB-Ns6iV-sNHptnA3tVLzBW2dd_1k95RyVFS_KF6n4HgReEYbc89vW2nCeYv5z-8kU3AO3Dini3cL8b-KUhgkVWkflvA=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<WmMVVo-4y-FJFwOjB-Ns6iV-sNHptnA3tVLzBW2dd_1k95RyVFS_KF6n4HgReEYbc89vW2nCeYv5z-8kU3AO3Dini3cL8b-KUhgkVWkflvA=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAHrPiLh+j21n6GNKm-tNFQJvAg-KvU2gg4B59ZqfbGPqweK_ag@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: Where is the lightswitch...?"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\\"0000000000004c8f6b063739042a\\""}], "body": {"size": 0}, "parts": [{"partId": "0", "mimeType": "text/plain", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}], "body": {"size": 1853, "data": "SGVsbG8gQnJhbmQsDQoNCkkgb3JkZXJlZCB0aGUgdG9wcGVyIG9uY2UgYWdhaW4gYW5kIGFjY29yZGluZyB0byB0aGUgd2Vic2l0ZSBzaG91bGQgYXJyaXZlDQp0aGlzIHdlZWsuDQoNCkFyZSB5b3Ugb2theSBpZiBJI