74	28	gmail	197647d677f5b899	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Where is the lightswitch...?	Hello Brand,\r\n\r\nWe received the Topper today!\r\nAre you okay if I ask the cleaning staff for tomorrow afternoon to pass by\r\nand do the topper placement and replacement of the sheets?\r\nIs around 12:00 suitable and are you then in or out, so far you know?\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander\r\n\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Tue, 10 Jun 2025 at 19:15, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> Sure no problem.  Before you come please text me just to make sure I'm not\r\n> on a zoom.  But that would be great thanks you!\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n> On Tuesday, 10 June 2025 at 17:05, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hello Brand,\r\n>\r\n> I ordered the topper once again and according to the website should arrive\r\n> this week.\r\n>\r\n> Are you okay if I received it that me or Alberto can place it? then we\r\n> will ask the cleaning staff directly to replace the sheets as well.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n>\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Thu, 5 Jun 2025 at 15:00, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Got it, I thought that was a smoke alarm. Thank you!\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards\r\n>>\r\n>> Brand\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>> On Thursday, 5 June 2025 at 14:55, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\n>> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>> Hello Brand,\r\n>>\r\n>> There is a round switch or in the kitchen closets on the inside left or\r\n>> right.\r\n>>\r\n>> Or it is placed under the kitchen closet, from the underside upwards.\r\n>>\r\n>> If you like I can ask Alberto to come by and help out.\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards, Sander\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Short-Stay Inn\r\n>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n>> The Netherlands\r\n>>\r\n>> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>>\r\n>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>>\r\n>> Op do 5 jun 2025, 14:44 schreef brandscheffer <\r\n>> brandscheffer@protonmail.com>:\r\n>>\r\n>>> Hi Sander\r\n>>>\r\n>>> This is a pretty stupid question, but where is the lightswitch for the\r\n>>> under cabinet lighting in the kitchen?\r\n>>>\r\n>>> After the power cut this morning, when the electricity came back, the\r\n>>> lights were on unde the cabinets in the kitchen. I have tried everything to\r\n>>> turn them off but can't find a switch that controls those lights. Do you\r\n>>> know how to turn them off?\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Thanks!\r\n>>>\r\n>>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>>\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n	2025-06-12 14:13:48+00	{"gmail": {"id": "197647d677f5b899", "threadId": "1973fe7c29c5f1a4", "labelIds": ["Label_4139206071984797100", "SENT"], "snippet": "Hello Brand, We received the Topper today! Are you okay if I ask the cleaning staff for tomorrow afternoon to pass by and do the topper placement and replacement of the sheets? Is around 12:00 suitable", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Thu, 12 Jun 2025 16:13:48 +0200"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<vbfOetzrgFhXYLCzAAI0v055vnrbrklbHyWt4auD9ZbGnga1rBNAgDgKd-uEsNDMRLVyxLtAc0i9JGoqlQPz50mcVHy4xW5wjnpimS0XCAw=@protonmail.com> <CAHrPiLgvXmBJBwByqMoDaX-QqEA27OF76OL42mLdWCs5PDaY7w@mail.gmail.com> <WmMVVo-4y-FJFwOjB-Ns6iV-sNHptnA3tVLzBW2dd_1k