75	28	gmail	197648138116f94d	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Re: Where is the lightswitch...?	Hi Sander\n\nTomorrow 12 will be fine. I'll make sure I'm here.\n\nThanks!\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n\nOn Thursday, 12 June 2025 at 16:14, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n\n> Hello Brand,\n>\n> We received the Topper today!\n> Are you okay if I ask the cleaning staff for tomorrow afternoon to pass by and do the topper placement and replacement of the sheets?\n> Is around 12:00 suitable and are you then in or out, so far you know?\n>\n> Kind regards,\n> Sander\n>\n> Short-Stay Inn\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK EnschedeThe Netherlands\n>\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\n>\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\n>\n> On Tue, 10 Jun 2025 at 19:15, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\n>\n>> Hi Sander\n>>\n>> Sure no problem. Before you come please text me just to make sure I'm not on a zoom. But that would be great thanks you!\n>>\n>> Brand Scheffer\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>\n>> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n>>\n>> On Tuesday, 10 June 2025 at 17:05, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n>>\n>>> Hello Brand,\n>>>\n>>> I ordered the topper once again and according to the website should arrive this week.\n>>>\n>>> Are you okay if I received it that me or Alberto can place it? then we will ask the cleaning staff directly to replace the sheets as well.\n>>>\n>>> Kind regards, Sander\n>>>\n>>> Short-Stay Inn\n>>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK EnschedeThe Netherlands\n>>>\n>>> www.ShortStayInn.com\n>>>\n>>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\n>>>\n>>> On Thu, 5 Jun 2025 at 15:00, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\n>>>\n>>>> Got it, I thought that was a smoke alarm. Thank you!\n>>>>\n>>>> Kind regards\n>>>>\n>>>> Brand\n>>>>\n>>>> Brand Scheffer\n>>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>>>\n>>>> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.\n>>>>\n>>>> On Thursday, 5 June 2025 at 14:55, Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\n>>>>\n>>>>> Hello Brand,\n>>>>>\n>>>>> There is a round switch or in the kitchen closets on the inside left or right.\n>>>>>\n>>>>> Or it is placed under the kitchen closet, from the underside upwards.\n>>>>>\n>>>>> If you like I can ask Alberto to come by and help out.\n>>>>>\n>>>>> Kind regards, Sander\n>>>>>\n>>>>> Short-Stay Inn\n>>>>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK EnschedeThe Netherlands\n>>>>>\n>>>>> www.ShortStayInn.com\n>>>>>\n>>>>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\n>>>>>\n>>>>> Op do 5 jun 2025, 14:44 schreef brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>:\n>>>>>\n>>>>>> Hi Sander\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> This is a pretty stupid question, but where is the lightswitch for the under cabinet lighting in the kitchen?\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> After the power cut this morning, when the electricity came back, the lights were on unde the cabinets in the kitchen. I have tried everything to turn them off but can't find a switch that controls those lights. Do you know how to turn them off?\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Thanks!\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Brand Scheffer\n>>>>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\n>>>>>>\n>>>>>> Sent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2025-06-12 14:17:53+00	{"gmail": {"id": "197648138116f94d", "threadId": "1973fe7c29c5f1a4", "labelIds": ["IMPORTANT", "Label_4139206071984797100", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"], "snippet": "Hi Sander Tomorrow 12 will be fine. I&#39;ll make sure I&#39;m here. Thanks! Brand Scheffer Direct: +356 7903 4134 Sent with Proton Mail secure email. On Thursday, 12 June 2025 at 16:14, Short-Stay Inn", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:7301:1e92:b0:175:c6e2:e7b5 with SMTP id oo18csp1675740dyb;        Thu, 12 Jun 2025 07:18:00 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "X-Google-Smtp-Source", 