76	29	gmail	196fdff00a92ccde	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Arrival Wednesday	Hi Sander\n\nI received confirmation from ABN that the amount of 2309.78 € was sent to your account. So that should appear in your receipts shortly if it hasn't already.\n\nMy travel plans are still on track. I leave this coming Monday afternoon and arrive in Amsterdam Tuesday afternoon. I will stay in a Schiphol hotel that night and catch a train on Wednesday morning and should be in Enschede around lunchtime. I will text you the exact train times.\n\nWhat are my next steps? What's the exact address, is it self check in and if so what are the codes, can I walk from the station or do I need a cab?\n\nLook forward to hearing from you.\n\nKind regards\n\nBrand Scheffer\nDirect: +356 7903 4134\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2025-05-23 16:34:21+00	{"gmail": {"id": "196fdff00a92ccde", "threadId": "196fdff00a92ccde", "labelIds": ["IMPORTANT", "Label_4139206071984797100", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"], "snippet": "Hi Sander I received confirmation from ABN that the amount of 2309.78 \\u20ac was sent to your account. So that should appear in your receipts shortly if it hasn&#39;t already. My travel plans are still on", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:7300:fb81:b0:172:28ad:e2d7 with SMTP id aj1csp2617846dyc;        Fri, 23 May 2025 09:34:29 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "X-Google-Smtp-Source", "value": "AGHT+IGsbOIV4S/ME859Voxn/KpM38ONpeUuD/QrzFZ260/Oj9EacUKUwOPGj642IfYWZtE8fI1W"}, {"name": "X-Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6902:6081:b0:e7d:3c89:3b81 with SMTP id 3f1490d57ef6-e7d91890b0amr192012276.4.1748018069680;        Fri, 23 May 2025 09:34:29 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "ARC-Seal", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; t=1748018069; cv=none;        d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        b=HelfrBA