77	29	gmail	19701ce6bb1ffbe5	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Arrival Wednesday	Hi Brand,\r\n\r\nThank you for confirming the payment; we have received it.\r\n\r\nYour studio is located approximately 300 meters from the station. You can\r\nfind the exact location on this map: Studio 3 - Deurningerstraat\r\n<https://beds24.com/booking2.php?roomid=262379>. The full address is\r\nDeurningerstraat 14C, 7514BH in Enschede.\r\nPlease ring the doorbell at 12-D, and the intercom will connect you with me\r\nor my colleague Alberto.\r\n\r\nYour studio is on the second floor, which is the top floor. You will find\r\nthe keys for both your room and the main entrance downstairs inside the\r\nstudio.\r\n\r\nI will do my best to be there to welcome you upon your arrival if the time\r\nworks with my schedule. If not, I would be happy to meet you a little later\r\nto complete the check-in process.\r\n\r\nRegarding the mattress topper, I received an update last Friday that it is\r\ncurrently at a sorting center in Germany. I am still hopeful that it will\r\narrive on time, although the delivery has taken a bit longer than initially\r\nexpected.\r\n\r\nI hope this information answers all your questions. If anything is unclear\r\nor if you have any further questions, please do not hesitate to ask.\r\n\r\nWishing you safe travels!\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nSander\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Fri, 23 May 2025 at 18:34, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\nwrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> I received confirmation from ABN that the amount of 2309.78 € was sent to\r\n> your account.  So that should appear in your receipts shortly if it hasn't\r\n> already.\r\n>\r\n> My travel plans are still on track.  I leave this coming Monday afternoon\r\n> and arrive in Amsterdam Tuesday afternoon.  I will stay in a Schiphol hotel\r\n> that night and catch a train on Wednesday morning and should be in Enschede\r\n> around lunchtime.  I will text you the exact train times.\r\n>\r\n> What are my next steps? What's the exact address, is it self check in and\r\n> if so what are the codes, can I walk from the station or do I need a cab?\r\n>\r\n> Look forward to hearing from you.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n	2025-05-24 10:19:55+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19701ce6bb1ffbe5", "threadId": "196fdff00a92ccde", "labelIds": ["Label_4139206071984797100", "SENT"], "snippet": "Hi Brand, Thank you for confirming the payment; we have received it. Your studio is located approximately 300 meters from the station. You can find the exact location on this map: Studio 3 -", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Sat, 24 May 2025 12:19:55 +0200"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<_zvyrbt8gUyvgLIXLcrqlJR-_vxG8zJrVsxEQHsPFpSHtSpxZgib_yJH-GGzE-ujZdRM9dS8OrIgDrJ-9KTa03gtZCh7-hSxjMTLc8bnqrc=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<_zvyrbt8gUyvgLIXLcrqlJR-_vxG8zJrVsxEQHsPFpSHtSpxZgib_yJH-GGzE-ujZdRM9dS8OrIgDrJ-9KTa03gtZCh7-hSxjMTLc8bnqrc=@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAHrPiLhDAOJtTeReda84WBwwn-4-qj9W6DjP9JurE11R+P-GRQ@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: Arrival Wednesday"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\\"0000000000005057960635df0ec3\\""}], "body": {"size": 0}, "parts": [{"partId": "0", "mimeType": "text/plain", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}, {"name": "Content-Transfer-Encoding",