82	33	gmail	196cde806d6a1d1d	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	info+rentals@shortstayinn.com	Re: Short-Stay Inn advert form "[your-subject]"	Dear mr Scheffer,\r\n\r\nthank you for the request, we also received your request for the other\r\nlocation on the Atjehstraat. however Atjehstraat is occupied, but we have 4\r\ndifferent locations available for the requested dates.\r\n\r\nIf you are willing to fill out this link: then we are able to search more\r\nspecific to your requirements.\r\n\r\nKind regards, Sander Lock\r\n------------------------------\r\nDear Mr. Scheffer,\r\n\r\nThank you for your inquiry. We also received your request regarding the\r\nAtjehstraat location. Unfortunately, that appartment is currently occupied.\r\n\r\nHowever, we do have 4 other locations available during the dates you\r\nrequested.\r\n\r\nTo help us find the most suitable option for you, could you please fill out\r\nthis form: [https://beds24.com/book-guestfillout]? This will allow us to\r\nbetter understand your specific requirements.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nSander Lock\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Tue, 13 May 2025 at 20:53, <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Hi Short-Stay Inn,\r\n>\r\n> Someone just contacted you via Short-Stay Inn!\r\n> You can find the details below.\r\n>\r\n> From: Brand Scheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n> Contact for Bilderdijkstraat A (studio 5) (Minimum stay = 1 week)\r\n> <https://shortstayinn.com/rental/bilderdijkstraat-studio-5-minimaal-verblijf-1-week/>\r\n>\r\n> Message:\r\n> 21st May for 3 months one person occupancy\r\n>\r\n> --\r\n> This e-mail was sent from a Bilderdijkstraat A (studio 5) (Minimum stay =\r\n> 1 week)\r\n> <https://shortstayinn.com/rental/bilderdijkstraat-studio-5-minimaal-verblijf-1-week/>\r\n> .\r\n> Replying to this e-mail, will automatically reply to the customer (\r\n> brandscheffer@protonmai