91	33	gmail	196e6e923dcf9ab8	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	Re: Short-Stay Inn advert form "[your-subject]"	No worries, thanks for the heads up!\r\n\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\nOp ma 19 mei 2025, 04:22 schreef brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com\r\n>:\r\n\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> Please note funds will not leave my bank until Monday.  I just saw the\r\n> notice that it won't leave until the next business day.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n> On Saturday, May 17th, 2025 at 3:16 PM, brandscheffer <\r\n> brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hi Sander\r\n>\r\n> Good to hear about the mattress topper. Much appreciated. Regarding length\r\n> of stay, I'll stick with 94 days, if that needs to be adjusted we can\r\n> discuss when I'm there,\r\n>\r\n> I think my flight arrives from Paris in the afternoon, I'm doing a crazy\r\n> journey from LA to Paris to Amsterdam, long story but it saves me $2000.\r\n> So, I think I will stay in Amsterdam the evening of the 27th and then take\r\n> the train the following morning.  I decided I couldn't face another 3 hours\r\n> on the train.\r\n>\r\n> I will let you know my arrival in Enschede when I book it, but it will\r\n> likely be around lunch time on the 28th.\r\n>\r\n> I transferred the first tranche to your bank.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards\r\n>\r\n> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n> Direct:  +356 7903 4134\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>\r\n> On Friday, May 16th, 2025 at 11:04 PM, Short-Stay Inn <\r\n> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Good morning Brand,\r\n>\r\n> Nice talking to you yesterday, and once againg thank you for choosing\r\n> Short-Stay Inn for your accommodation.\r\n>\r\n> Regarding your request for a mattress topper, we were unable to locate one\r\n> immediately. Therefore, I have ordered a new one, which is guaranteed to\r\n> arrive before your arrival on the 27th (according to the website). So we\r\n> will ensure it is set up for you if it arrives on time.\r\n>\r\n> I have adjusted your arrival date to the 27th of this month. Could you\r\n> please confirm whether you would like to maintain a total of 94 nights for\r\n> your stay or if you prefer to keep August 25th as your departure date? It's\r\n> no problem to let me know later of course after your arrival.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n>\r\n> Sander\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n> <https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tromplaan+8,+7511JK+Enschede+The+Netherlands?entry=gmail&source=g>\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n> <https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tromplaan+8,+7511JK+Enschede+The+Netherlands?entry=gmail&source=g>\r\n>\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Sat, 17 May 2025 at 01:33, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n> wrote:\r\n>\r\n>> Hi Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> Further to our conversation earlier today (probably yesterday for you) I\r\n>> just wanted to confirm I will accept your proposed studio unit near the\r\n>> train station in the centre of town.\r\n>>\r\n>> As discussed my dates are now arrival on the 27th of this month, not sure\r\n>> what tie I land at Schiphol but I'll advise you of that in due course. If\r\n>> you can confirm a mattress toppper to turn the two singles into a double,\r\n>> that will be great.\r\n>>\r\n>> I will transfer the first tranche to your bank shortly.\r\n>>\r\n>> Looking forward to meeting you,\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>> On Thursday, May 15th, 2025 at 8:36 AM, brandscheffer <\r\n>> brandscheffer@protonmail.com> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>> Dear Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> Thanks for the quick response.\r\n>>\r\n>> Your suggestion sounds good and I am certainly available for a Zoom or\r\n>> Teams call. There is a 9 hour time difference between us, but if we arrange\r\n>> sometime between 7 am and 9 am my time that would be 4pm and 6pm your time\r\n>> that would work.\r\n>>\r\n>> Just let me know when you want to do that and I will make myself\r\n>> available.\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards\r\n>>\r\n>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>\r\n>> On Thursday, May 15th, 2025 at 6:41 AM, Short-Stay Inn <\r\n>> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>> Dear Mr. Scheffer,\r\n>>\r\n>> Thank you for the additional information. We appreciate you providing a\r\n>> clearer understanding of your requirements. We also noted your preference\r\n>> for English and perhaps your Dutch will improve during your stay in the\r\n>> Netherlands!\r\n>>\r\n>> To further discuss your needs or if you have any questions, we would be\r\n>> happy to schedule a video call at your convenience.\r\n>>\r\n>> Based on your preferences, I have attached a quotation for a luxurious\r\n>> studio that might be a great fit for you. It enjoys a convenient location\r\n>> near the city center and the central station and features high-speed fiber\r\n>> optic internet with speeds up to 1000 Mbps, as well as a private bathroom\r\n>> and kitchen.\r\n>>\r\n>> Please feel free to reach out if you have any questions about this option.\r\n>>\r\n>> Kind regards,\r\n>>\r\n>> Sander\r\n>>\r\n>> Short-Stay Inn\r\n>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n>> <https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tromplaan+8,+7511JK+Enschede+The+Netherlands?entry=gmail&source=g>\r\n>> The Netherlands\r\n>> <https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tromplaan+8,+7511JK+Enschede+The+Netherlands?entry=gmail&source=g>\r\n>>\r\n>> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>>\r\n>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>> On Wed, 14 May 2025 at 18:20, brandscheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n>> wrote:\r\n>>\r\n>>> Hello\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Thanks for your response. I have filled in your calendar, but I didn't\r\n>>> see any other questions or information you were looking for. So to recap\r\n>>> and give you a better idea, I have provided some more details.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> I am a Dutch national, born 1952, but my written Dutch is so bad I write\r\n>>> in English. I am currently in the US, (Los Angeles) hence the time lag in\r\n>>> replying. I need to be back in NL for 3 months to sort out some personal\r\n>>> administrative issues but will continue to work remotely. So internet is\r\n>>> essential for me.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> On your calendar, I listed 92 days, but I can be flexible. I suggested\r\n>>> arrival on 23rd of this month and departure on the 25th of August. I'm\r\n>>> happy to move those dates around a little if that makes it easier.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> I am looking for a self contained unit where I can stay and work while I\r\n>>> sort out my personal affairs. So that means a bed preferably a double, a\r\n>>> bathroom and a kitchen. It could be a studio or small apartment.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> I hope that's sufficient information for you, but let me know if you\r\n>>> need more.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Look forward to hearing from you\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Regards\r\n>>>\r\n>>> *Brand Scheffer*\r\n>>> Direct: +356 7903 4134\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Sent with Proton Mail <https://proton.me/mail/home> secure email.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> On Wednesday, May 14th, 2025 at 1:29 AM, Short-Stay Inn <\r\n>>> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Dear Mr. Scheffer,\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Thank you for your inquiry. We also received your request regarding the\r\n>>> Atjehstraat location. Unfortunately, that apartment is currently occupied.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> However, we do have 4 other locations available during the dates you\r\n>>> requested.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> To help us find the most suitable option for you, could you please fill\r\n>>> out this form: [https://beds24.com/book-guestfillout]? This will allow\r\n>>> us to better understand your specific requirements.\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Kind regards,\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Sander Lock\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Short-Stay Inn\r\n>>> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n>>> <https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tromplaan+8,+7511JK+Enschede+The+Netherlands?entry=gmail&source=g>\r\n>>> The Netherlands\r\n>>> <https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tromplaan+8,+7511JK+Enschede+The+Netherlands?entry=gmail&source=g>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>>>\r\n>>> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>> On Tue, 13 May 2025 at 20:53, <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>>>\r\n>>>> Hi Short-Stay Inn,\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> Someone just contacted you via Short-Stay Inn!\r\n>>>> You can find the details below.\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> From: Brand Scheffer <brandscheffer@protonmail.com>\r\n>>>> Contact for Bilderdijkstraat A (studio 5) (Minimum stay = 1 week)\r\n>>>> <https://shortstayinn.com/rental/bilderdijkstraat-studio-5-minimaal-verblijf-1-week/>\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> Message:\r\n>>>> 21st May for 3 months one person occupancy\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>> --\r\n>>>> This e-mail was sent from a Bilderdijkstraat A (studio 5) (Minimum\r\n>>>> stay = 1 week)\r\n>>>> <https://shortstayinn.com/rental/bilderdijkstraat-studio-5-minimaal-verblijf-1-week/>\r\n>>>> .\r\n>>>> Replying to this e-mail, will automatically reply to the customer (\r\n>>>> brandscheffer@protonmail.com).\r\n>>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>>\r\n>>\r\n>>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n	2025-05-19 04:59:19+00	{"gmail": {"id": "196e6e923dcf9ab8", "threadId": "196cafe74bfd2a52", "labelIds": ["Label_4139206071984797100", "SENT"], "snippet": "No worries, thanks for the heads up! Short-Stay Inn Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede The Netherlands www.ShortStayInn.com Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946 Op ma 19 mei 2025, 04:22 schreef brandscheffer &lt;", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "valu