103	40	gmail	19ead6d233941a70	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	jim_kaplan@brown.edu	Your Check-In Information	Dear Jim,\r\n\r\nThank you for choosing to stay with us. We're delighted to confirm your reservation and look forward to welcoming you on Wednesday, 10 June, 2026.\r\n\r\nTo ensure a smooth check-in, please use the code 3549 to enter the building on the day of your arrival. This is the only valid code for check-in, so please don't use any others you might receive. After you've checked in, you can use the key provided in your room to access the building and lock your room.\r\n\r\nYou'll also find a digital flipbook with all the necessary information for your stay. You can access it here: https://notre.guide/EnscheDayInn?clientname=Kaplan&clientfirstname=Jim\r\n\r\nYour room number is 5 (on the ground floor). Should you have any questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to contact us.\r\n\r\nWe hope you have a comfortable and enjoyable stay!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nAlberto\r\nBilderdijkstraat 23, 7514 CN Enschede	2026-06-09 17:27:50+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19ead6d233941a70", "threadId": "19ead6d233941a70", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Jim, Thank you for choosing to stay with us. We&#39;re delighted to confirm your reservation and look forward to welcoming you on Wednesday, 10 June, 2026. To ensure a smooth check-in, please use", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Return-Path", "value": "<info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "from mail.xmlcal.com (mail.beds24.com. [188.34.132.40])        by smtp.gmail.com with ESMTPSA id 5b1f17b1804b1-490bc3918fcsm571132215e9.3.2026.06.09.10.27.50        for <jim_kaplan@brown.edu>        (version=TLS1_3 cipher=TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 bits=256/256);        Tue, 09 Jun 2026 10:27:51 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Tu