104	41	gmail	19eab6f593ad6153	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	jim_kaplan@brown.edu	Introduction of your Location Manager	Dear Jim,Throughout the booking process, I have been your main contact for all questions. As my role mainly focuses on booking arrangements, it now comes to an end.As a preparation for your arrival, and to make sure on-site matters are handled directly, I would like to introduce my colleague Alberto, the Location Manager of your booked accommodation. From this moment on, he will be your first point of contact for any questions.Alberto personally takes care of on-site matters such as check-in and check-out, as well as repairs, improvements and maintenance. He speaks English, Spanish, German, Portuguese and Dutch, so you can easily reach out in the language that suits you best.You can contact Alberto directly by phone or WhatsApp at +31 6 41722332, or by email at info@enschedayinn.com.For many useful answers, you may also visit: Digital Leaflet.For any administrative purposes such as extensions, shortenings, invoices, or planning, you can still contact me directly. Of course, I will also remain active in the background, and Alberto and I will stay in close contact to ensure your questions or requests are answered quickly.Kind regards,Sander Lock\r\nInfo@shorstayinn.com\r\n+31538200946	2026-06-09 08:11:01+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19eab6f593ad6153", "threadId": "19eab6f593ad6153", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Jim, Throughout the booking process, I have been your main contact for all questions. As my role mainly focuses on booking arrangements, it now comes to an end. As a preparation for your arrival,", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Return-Path", "value": "<info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "from mail.xmlcal.com (mail.beds24.com. [188.34.132.40])        by smtp.gmail.com with ESMTPSA id ffacd0b85a97d-4601f34413csm59001152f8f.21.2026.06.09.01.11.01        