114	50	gmail	19e08978cfa69b07	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	uller.gabriela@gmail.com	Re: >>-Gabriela Uller-<< requests for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 1) (minimum stay = 1 week)"	Dear Gabriela Uller,\r\n\r\nThank you for your inquiry regarding a stay at our Deurningerstraat (Studio\r\n1). We appreciate you reaching out to us. Regarding your request for\r\nDeurningerstraat (Studio 1), we will check the availability for the\r\nrequested period. Please read through this email so we can search for the\r\nmost suitable solution.\r\n\r\n**= Registration =**\r\nYou asked about the possibility to register at this address. Yes, we have\r\npossibilities to register at our locations. If needed, we will arrange the\r\npaperwork a few days upon your appointment at the City Hall.\r\n\r\n**= Booking Information =**\r\nRegarding documentation required for booking, we generally do not require a\r\nwork contract for the initial booking. However, for registration purposes\r\nwith the municipality, some documents might be requested by the City Hall\r\nlater, which we can help guide you through.\r\n\r\nIt's great to hear you are moving to the Netherlands with your husband.\r\nMany scientists, researchers, and PhD students choose to stay with us, as\r\nthe duration of their stay can easily be adjusted if their project timeline\r\nchanges. This is due to our highly flexible extension and shortening\r\npolicies. Extensions are subject to availability, and shortening is\r\npossible with a 7-day notice period. This flexibility often brings peace of\r\nmind during a potentially uncertain period.\r\n\r\nOur accommodation is operated as a high-end self-service stay, offering\r\nguests a high level of privacy, independence, and comfort. The concept is\r\ndesigned to provide a homely yet professional environment, well suited for\r\nboth living and focused work during longer stays. All essential services\r\nand facilities are fully arranged and included, such as utilities, WiFi,\r\nall taxes, cleaning of the common areas, use of the washing machine and\r\ndryer (including detergent), coffee and tea, coffee milk, sugar, and toilet\r\npaper. All cleaning supplies and materials are also available to support\r\neasy self-service.\r\n\r\nTo proceed with a search for the most suitable solution and provide a\r\nquotation, we would like to confirm the following details:\r\n* **Budget: what is your approx budget for a short-stay facility?\r\n* **Requirements: Studio 1 has a shared kitchen, we might have full private\r\nkitchen, would this be your preferance, eventhough the price would be\r\nhigher?\r\n\r\nIf you like, we can send you a full quotation with the details and pictures\r\nof the most suitable location.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander Lock\r\n\r\nThis request is known under ID: 86492064\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nHoogstraat 65\r\n7512GW Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\nPhone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946 (whatsapp)\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n	2026-05-08 17:16:51+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19e08978cfa69b07", "threadId": "19e0874da96dae26", "labelIds": ["Label_1738314444454715560", "SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Gabriela Uller, Thank you for your inquiry regarding a stay at our Deurningerstraat (Studio 1). We appreciate you reaching out to us. Regarding your request for Deurningerstraat (Studio 1), we", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Fri, 8 May 2026 19:16:51 +0200"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<CAHrPiLheanEoUyUFrJ7NE1T0NfbaO_HYsbCOZRoZm9zwoLNtwA@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<CAHrPiLheanEoUyUFrJ7NE1T0NfbaO_HYsbCOZRoZm9zwoLNtwA@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAHrPiLhx-FQfzL3cBOxpJC78i+dGagJf2LpaMOfkzRSUgniGVg@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: >>-Gabriela Uller-<< requests for:\\"Deurningerstraat (Studio 1) (minimum stay = 1 week)\\""}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <inf