115	50	gmail	19e08a92cd47cad8	inbound	uller.gabriela@gmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	Re: >>-Gabriela Uller-<< requests for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 1) (minimum stay = 1 week)"	Hi, thank you for your response.\r\n\r\nIt would be good if the budget was around 2,000 euros per month, and it is\r\nokay for us to have a shared kitchen.\r\n\r\nThank you again\r\n\r\nGabriela\r\n\r\nOn Fri 8 May 2026, 14:17 Short-Stay Inn, <info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Dear Gabriela Uller,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you for your inquiry regarding a stay at our Deurningerstraat\r\n> (Studio 1). We appreciate you reaching out to us. Regarding your request\r\n> for Deurningerstraat (Studio 1), we will check the availability for the\r\n> requested period. Please read through this email so we can search for the\r\n> most suitable solution.\r\n>\r\n> **= Registration =**\r\n> You asked about the possibility to register at this address. Yes, we have\r\n> possibilities to register at our locations. If needed, we will arrange the\r\n> paperwork a few days upon your appointment at the City Hall.\r\n>\r\n> **= Booking Information =**\r\n> Regarding documentation required for booking, we generally do not require\r\n> a work contract for the initial booking. However, for registration purposes\r\n> with the municipality, some documents might be requested by the City Hall\r\n> later, which we can help guide you through.\r\n>\r\n> It's great to hear you are moving to the Netherlands with your husband.\r\n> Many scientists, researchers, and PhD students choose to stay with us, as\r\n> the duration of their stay can easily be adjusted if their project timeline\r\n> changes. This is due to our highly flexible extension and shortening\r\n> policies. Extensions are subject to availability, and shortening is\r\n> possible with a 7-day notice period. This flexibility often brings peace of\r\n> mind during a potentially uncertain period.\r\n>\r\n> Our accommodation is operated as a high-end self-service stay, offering\r\n> guests a high level of privacy, independence, and comfort. The concept is\r\n> designed to provide a homely yet professional environment, well suited for\r\n> both living and focused work during longer stays. All essential services\r\n> and facilities are fully arranged and included, such as utilities, WiFi,\r\n> all taxes, cleaning of the common areas, use of the washing machine and\r\n> dryer (including detergent), coffee and tea, coffee milk, sugar, and toilet\r\n> paper. All cleaning supplies and materials are also available to support\r\n> easy self-service.\r\n>\r\n> To proceed with a search for the most suitable solution and provide a\r\n> quotation, we would like to confirm the following details:\r\n> * **Budget: what is your approx budget for a short-stay facility?\r\n> * **Requirements: Studio 1 has a shared kitchen, we might have full\r\n> private kitchen, would this be your preferance, eventhough the price would\r\n> be higher?\r\n>\r\n> If you like, we can send you a full quotation with the details and\r\n> pictures of the most suitable location.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n> Sander Lock\r\n>\r\n> This request is known under ID: 86492064\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Hoogstraat 65\r\n> 7512GW Enschede\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n> Phone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946 (whatsapp)\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n	2026-05-08 17:35:52+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19e08a92cd47cad8", "threadId": "19e0874da96dae26", "labelIds": ["Label_1738314444454715560", "IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL", "INBOX"], "snippet": "Hi, thank you for your response. It would be good if the budget was around 2000 euros per month, and it is okay for us to have a shared kitchen. Thank you again Gabriela On Fri 8 May 2026, 14:17 Short-", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:693c:2b11:b0:2e5:7652:c6c0 with SMTP id ro17csp285620dyc;  