158	79	gmail	199299c7f254a7e2	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	ksuke0621wondall@gmail.com	Introduction Location Manager - Alberto	Dear Keisuke Fujiwara,\r\nAs I may have mentioned before, now that my colleague Alberto is back from his holidays,he will take over a large part of the daily work.\r\nFrom today onwards, Alberto will be your first point of contact for many questions, while I will remain responsible for the administrative side.\r\nPlease see below who to contact for each type of question:Operational matters → Alberto\r\nAlberto is our Location Manager and personally takes care of everything on-site. Please contact him for:Cleaning schedules and extra towels or bed linenCheck-in or access questions (door code, keys)Technicalissues (heating, appliances, hot water)General facilities (washing machine, kitchen, WiFi, TV)\r\nYou can reach Alberto by phone or WhatsApp at +31 6 41722332, or via the standard messaging system of Booking.com.\r\nHe speaks English, Spanish, German, Portuguese, and Dutch, so feel free to contact him in the language that suits you best.Many useful answers can also be found here: https://notre.guide/CentralDayInn.Administrative matters → Sander\r\nFor all administrative or financial questions, please continue to contact me directly at info@shortstayinn.com or by phone or WhatsApp at +31 53 8200946. Examples include:Invoices and payment questionsDeposit refunds or damage handlingContracts, registration, or proof of deregistration\r\n\r\nMany useful answers can also be found here: https://notre.guide/ShortStayInn.Kind regards,\r\nSander﻿	2025-09-08 13:55:45+00	{"gmail": {"id": "199299c7f254a7e2", "threadId": "199299c7f254a7e2", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Keisuke Fujiwara, As I may have mentioned before, now that my colleague Alberto is back from his holidays,he will take over a large part of the daily work. From today onwards, Alberto will be your", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "h