159	80	gmail	1990ea39b06ae3ad	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	kalsharajapaksa@gmail.com	Updated payment status	Hi Kalsha,\r\nJohanna told me your feedback on the Januari payment, it is correct that what you said that the payment was in totaly done. So I will explain why it looks different in the overview. In the first line at the description you can see between () that the total payment was €1985 (in this overview I colored it yellow). The reason that in the "Paid" column it shows €1016.81, is because of the split-up that I made in the system between the year 2024 and the year 2025. \r\n\r\nIn this way the balance of each year is correctly booked. I should have explained this of course directly when we started with sending these overview, but unfortunately I forgot to.\r\nHope this explains it all, if not then let me know please !Kind regards, \r\nShort-Stay Inn﻿Payment status \r\n                                                  Short-Stay Inn\r\nHoedemakerplein 2\r\n7511 JP Enschede\r\n+31 (0) 53 820 0 946\r\nKvK: 62430610\r\nVAT-ID: NL002480262B34\r\nLast updated:\r\nTenant name:\r\nBooking no: 3 Sep 2025\r\nKalsha Rajapaksa (1P) ( SSI)\r\n67516957               Check inn:\r\nCheck out:\r\nNights: 1 Jan 2025\r\n31 Oct 2025\r\n303\r\nDescription Quantity Price Vat % Vat Total \r\n 303 €65.51 9% €1,638.95 €19,849.53 \r\n\r\nTotal prices (Including Citytax & VAT; excluding deposit):Price/night:\r\nPrice/week:\r\nPrice/month:\r\n€65.51\r\n€458.57\r\n€1992.60\r\n                                                  Deposit:\r\n(Refunded after check-out\r\n if no damages)\r\n €0.00\r\n\r\n\r\nGrand Total (including deposit): \r\n€19,849.53 + €0.00€19849.53\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPaid:\r\nDescription Net Paid  \r\nSSI-Bank: received on: (1985.00)  1,016.81 13-Jan-2025 \r\nSSI-Bank: received on:  1,985.00 05-Feb-2025 \r\nSSI-Bank: received on:  1,985.00 11-Mar-2025 \r\nSSI-Bank: received on:  1,985.00 02-Apr-2025 \r\nSSI-Bank: received on:  1,985.00 05-May-2025 \r\nSSI-Bank: 