167	84	gmail	198ad7a39a84ed35	inbound	e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl	info@shortstayinn.com	Re: >>-Eduardo Silva de Freitas-<< requests for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)"	Dear Sander,\r\n\r\nThank you for sending me the quotation. I find it perfectly acceptable and am happy to agree with it. Could you please confirm whether the next step is to transfer the amount of €777.00 to IBAN NL52 INGB 0007 1966 78?\r\n\r\nI was also interested in the possibility you mentioned yesterday of booking for six months, in which case there would be no VAT. Would it be possible for me to receive a quotation for that option as well?\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nEduardo\r\n________________________________\r\nFrom: Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\nSent: Thursday, August 14, 2025 6:29 PM\r\nTo: Eduardo Silva de Freitas <e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl>\r\nSubject: Re: >>-Eduardo Silva de Freitas-<< requests for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)"\r\n\r\nYou don't often get email from info@shortstayinn.com. Learn why this is important<https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>\r\nDear Eduardo,\r\nAttached you can find the quotation for the requested period.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions and how you prefer to proceed.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander\r\n\r\n[http://shortstayinn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/Logo-Short-Stay-inn-1.png]\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com<http://www.ShortStayInn.com>\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Thu, 14 Aug 2025 at 18:13, e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl<mailto:e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl> <info@shortstayinn.com<mailto:info@shortstayinn.com>> wrote:\r\n\r\nHi Short-Stay Inn,\r\n\r\nSomeone just contacted you via Short-Stay Inn!\r\nYou can find the details below.\r\n\r\nFrom: Eduardo Silva de Freitas <e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl<mailto:e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl>>\r\nContact for Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum s