169	84	gmail	198b3c2499d1f639	inbound	e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl	info@shortstayinn.com	Re: >>-Eduardo Silva de Freitas-<< requests for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)"	Good afternoon Sander,\r\n\r\nThank you very much for sending through the quotation. I find the offer perfectly acceptable and am happy to agree with it.\r\n\r\nCould you please confirm whether the next step is to transfer the amount of €777.00 to the following account?\r\nIBAN: NL52 INGB 0007 1966 78\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your confirmation.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nEduardo\r\n________________________________\r\nFrom: Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\nSent: Saturday, August 16, 2025 3:20 PM\r\nTo: Eduardo Silva de Freitas <E.Silva.de.Freitas@asser.nl>\r\nSubject: Re: >>-Eduardo Silva de Freitas-<< requests for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)"\r\n\r\nYou don't often get email from info@shortstayinn.com. Learn why this is important<https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>\r\nGood afternoon Eduardo,\r\nThank you for your patience, attached you can find an offer for 183 nights.\r\n\r\nI just saw a mistake in my first quotation, this contains now citytax, but since we agreed you are going to register, you don't need to pay the citytax.\r\n\r\nof course once you made a decision I will change that to a correct calculation, my apologies that this mistake slipped in the quotation.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander Lock\r\n\r\n\r\n[http://shortstayinn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/Logo-Short-Stay-inn-1.png]\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com<http://www.ShortStayInn.com>\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Fri, 15 Aug 2025 at 13:25, Eduardo Silva de Freitas <E.Silva.de.Freitas@asser.nl<mailto:E.Silva.de.Freitas@asser.nl>> wrote:\r\nDear Sander,\r\n\r\nThank you for sending me the quotation. I find it perfectly acceptable and am happy to agree with it. Could you please confirm whether the next step is to transfer the amount of €777.00 to IBAN NL52 INGB 0007 1966 78?\r\n\r\nI was also interested in the possibility you mentioned yesterday of booking for six months, in which case there would be no VAT. Would it be possible for me to receive a quotation for that option as well?\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nEduardo\r\n________________________________\r\nFrom: Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com<mailto:info@shortstayinn.com>>\r\nSent: Thursday, August 14, 2025 6:29 PM\r\nTo: Eduardo Silva de Freitas <e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl<mailto:e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl>>\r\nSubject: Re: >>-Eduardo Silva de Freitas-<< requests for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)"\r\n\r\nYou don't often get email from info@shortstayinn.com<mailto:info@shortstayinn.com>. Learn why this is important<https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>\r\nDear Eduardo,\r\nAttached you can find the quotation for the requested period.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions and how you prefer to proceed.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander\r\n\r\n[http://shortstayinn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/Logo-Short-Stay-inn-1.png]\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com<http://www.ShortStayInn.com>\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Thu, 14 Aug 2025 at 18:13, e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl<mailto:e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl> <info@shortstayinn.com<mailto:info@shortstayinn.com>> wrote:\r\n\r\nHi Short-Stay Inn,\r\n\r\nSomeone just contacted you via Short-Stay Inn!\r\nYou can find the details below.\r\n\r\nFrom: Eduardo Silva de Freitas <e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl<mailto:e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl>>\r\nContact for Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)<https://shortstayinn.com/rental/cozy-1-person-studio-in-the-center-of-enschede/>\r\nPhonenumber: 0629183762\r\nMessage:\r\nDear,\r\n\r\nI would like to make a reservation for one person from February 19, 2026, to June 30, 20