170	84	gmail	198b7d3cfe2501b4	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl	Re: >>-Eduardo Silva de Freitas-<< requests for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)"	Dear Eduardo,\r\n\r\nThat's wonderful news! Thank you for booking with us.\r\nWould you prefer to confirm the first or 2nd offer? Or do you wish to make\r\nthat decision later, which is totaly fine.\r\n\r\nIts correct that you can confirm the booking by transferring €777 to:\r\nName: Short-Stay Inn\r\nIBAN: NL 52 INGB 0007 1966 78\r\nSwift code: INGBNL2A\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSander\r\n\r\nShort-Stay Inn\r\nTromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\nThe Netherlands\r\n\r\nwww.ShortStayInn.com\r\n\r\nTelephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n\r\n\r\nOn Sat, 16 Aug 2025 at 18:41, Eduardo Silva de Freitas <\r\nE.Silva.de.Freitas@asser.nl> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Good afternoon Sander,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you very much for sending through the quotation. I find the offer\r\n> perfectly acceptable and am happy to agree with it.\r\n>\r\n> Could you please confirm whether the next step is to transfer the amount\r\n> of €777.00 to the following account?\r\n> IBAN: NL52 INGB 0007 1966 78\r\n>\r\n> Looking forward to your confirmation.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n> Eduardo\r\n> ------------------------------\r\n> *From:* Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\n> *Sent:* Saturday, August 16, 2025 3:20 PM\r\n> *To:* Eduardo Silva de Freitas <E.Silva.de.Freitas@asser.nl>\r\n> *Subject:* Re: >>-Eduardo Silva de Freitas-<< requests\r\n> for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)"\r\n>\r\n> You don't often get email from info@shortstayinn.com. Learn why this is\r\n> important <https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>\r\n> Good afternoon Eduardo,\r\n> Thank you for your patience, attached you can find an offer for 183 nights.\r\n>\r\n> I just saw a mistake in my first quotation, this contains now citytax, but\r\n> since we agreed you are going to register, you don't need to pay the\r\n> citytax.\r\n>\r\n> of course once you made a decision I will change that to a correct\r\n> calculation, my apologies that this mistake slipped in the quotation.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n> Sander Lock\r\n>\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n>\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Fri, 15 Aug 2025 at 13:25, Eduardo Silva de Freitas <\r\n> E.Silva.de.Freitas@asser.nl> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Dear Sander,\r\n>\r\n> Thank you for sending me the quotation. I find it perfectly acceptable and\r\n> am happy to agree with it. Could you please confirm whether the next step\r\n> is to transfer the amount of €777.00 to IBAN NL52 INGB 0007 1966 78?\r\n>\r\n> I was also interested in the possibility you mentioned yesterday of\r\n> booking for six months, in which case there would be no VAT. Would it be\r\n> possible for me to receive a quotation for that option as well?\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n> Eduardo\r\n> ------------------------------\r\n> *From:* Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>\r\n> *Sent:* Thursday, August 14, 2025 6:29 PM\r\n> *To:* Eduardo Silva de Freitas <e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl>\r\n> *Subject:* Re: >>-Eduardo Silva de Freitas-<< requests\r\n> for:"Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)"\r\n>\r\n> You don't often get email from info@shortstayinn.com. Learn why this is\r\n> important <https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>\r\n> Dear Eduardo,\r\n> Attached you can find the quotation for the requested period.\r\n>\r\n> Please let me know if you have any questions and how you prefer to proceed.\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n> Sander\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Short-Stay Inn\r\n> Tromplaan 8, 7511JK Enschede\r\n> The Netherlands\r\n>\r\n> www.ShortStayInn.com\r\n>\r\n> Telephone: 0031 (0) 53 8200 946\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> On Thu, 14 Aug 2025 at 18:13, e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl <\r\n> info@shortstayinn.com> wrote:\r\n>\r\n> Hi Short-Stay Inn,\r\n>\r\n> Someone just contacted you via Short-Stay Inn!\r\n> You can find the details below.\r\n>\r\n> From: Eduardo Silva de Freitas <e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl>\r\n> Contact for Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1 week)\r\n> <https://shortstayinn.com/rental/cozy-1-person-studio-in-the-center-of-enschede/>\r\n> Phonenumber: 0629183762\r\n> Message:\r\n> Dear,\r\n>\r\n> I would like to make a reservation for one person from February 19, 2026,\r\n> to June 30, 2026. Please let me know if the dates are available and any\r\n> additional details I may need to complete the booking.\r\n>\r\n> Thank you for your assistance.\r\n>\r\n> Best regards,\r\n> Eduardo\r\n>\r\n> --\r\n> This e-mail was sent from a Deurningerstraat (Studio 2) (minimum stay = 1\r\n> week)\r\n> <https://shortstayinn.com/rental/cozy-1-person-studio-in-the-center-of-enschede/>\r\n> .\r\n> Replying to this e-mail, will automatically reply to the customer (\r\n> e.silva.de.freitas@asser.nl).\r\n>\r\n>\r\n	2025-08-17 11:39:26+00	{"gmail": {"id": "198b7d3cfe2501b4", "threadId": "198a95bc8c677bc5", "labelIds": ["Label_1738314444454715560", "SENT"], "snippet": "Dear Eduardo, That&#39;s wonderful news! Thank you for booking with us. Would you prefer to confirm the first or 2nd offer? Or do you wish to make that decision later, which is totaly fine. Its correct", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Sun, 17 Aug 2025 13:39:26 +0200"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<CAHrPiLiq6ZFWVeLWau3yEuS694JXhFaBn87-KHEmv3N4mep1og@mail.gmail.com> <CAHrPiLi87sz_f_tFSm8PujapCh_r+RBsEVKQo=J0KLZFFPuSNA@mail.gmail.com> <AS2P195MB2195761AE948195080EE9E73F534A@AS2P195MB2195.EURP195.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM> <CAHrPiLhhFqbuZRPLYRDjO7_1=DkO+KrHPZHPwbt+3mN-+vcA1Q@mail.gmail.com> <AS2P195MB2195AF603D107F9AF05F779BF537A@AS2P195MB2195.EURP195.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<AS2P195MB2195AF603D107F9AF05F779BF537A@AS2P195MB2195.EUR