191	95	gmail	196c884434200e8f	inbound	info+rentals@shortstayinn.com	ksuke0621wondall@gmail.com	Contact Short-Stay Inn - Bilderdijkstraat A (studio 4) (Minimum stay = 1 week)	<!doctype html>\n<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" dir="ltr" lang="en-GB">\n<head>\n<title>Contact Short-Stay Inn - Bilderdijkstraat A (studio 4) (Minimum stay = 1 week)</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<p>Hi Keisuke,\n</p>\n<p>Thank you for the message.<br />\nYour request has been received. We will reply to you as soon as possible.\n</p>\n<p>Message:<br />\nWe are a couple (my wife and I) planning to stay from the end of August 2025 for several months.<br />\nWe are planning to stay for about three months.\n</p>\n<p>Kind regards,\n</p>\n<p>The Short-Stay Inn Team\n</p>\n<p>--<br />\nThis e-mail was sent from a <a href="https://shortstayinn.com/rental/bilderdijkstraat-studio-4-minimaal-verblijf-1-week/">Bilderdijkstraat A (studio 4) (Minimum stay = 1 week)</a>.\n</p></body>\n</html>	2025-05-13 07:20:33+00	{"gmail": {"id": "196c884434200e8f", "threadId": "196c884434200e8f", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Hi Keisuke, Thank you for the message. Your request has been received. We will reply to you as soon as possible. Message: We are a couple (my wife and I) planning to stay from the end of August 2025", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "text/html", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Received", "value": "from 446095089806 named unknown by gmailapi.google.com with HTTPREST; Tue, 13 May 2025 02:20:33 -0500"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "from 446095089806 named unknown by gmailapi.google.com with HTTPREST; Tue, 13 May 2025 02:20:33 -0500"}, {"name": "X-Mailer", "value": "Postman SMTP 2.5.6 for WordPress (https://wordpress.org/plugins/post-smtp/)"}, {"name": "X-WPCF7-Content-Type", "value": "text/html"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/html; charset=UTF-8"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info+rentals@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Sender", "value": "rentals@shortsta