253	137	gmail	19e9ccc61ef92829	outbound	info@shortstayinn.com	prakash.thanikkal@apollotyres.com	Hope You Enjoyed Your Stay!	Hello again,\r\n\r\nI hope you had a pleasant trip and that you enjoyed your stay with us.\r\n\r\nI'm reaching out to kindly ask for your feedback. We're always working to make our guest experience the best it can be, and your insights are key to that. If you have a moment, we'd appreciate it if you could share your thoughts on your stay with us.\r\n\r\nFor any future visits or recommendations for friends, here is the link to our digital booklet: https://notre.guide/centraldayinn/.\r\n\r\nThank you once again for your visit.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nAlberto\r\nLocation Manager	2026-06-06 11:58:19+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19e9ccc61ef92829", "threadId": "19e9ccc61ef92829", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Hello again, I hope you had a pleasant trip and that you enjoyed your stay with us. I&#39;m reaching out to kindly ask for your feedback. We&#39;re always working to make our guest experience the best", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Return-Path", "value": "<info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "from mail.xmlcal.com (mail.beds24.com. [188.34.132.40])        by smtp.gmail.com with ESMTPSA id ffacd0b85a97d-4601f0a43e9sm34276813f8f.0.2026.06.06.04.58.20        for <Prakash.thanikkal@apollotyres.com>        (version=TLS1_3 cipher=TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 bits=256/256);        Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:58:20 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Sat, 06 Jun 2026 11:58:19 +0000"}, {"name": "Return-Path", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Reply-To", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "Prakash.thanikkal@apollotyres.com"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Hope You Enjoyed Your Stay!"}, {"name": "X-Action-Id", "val