251	135	gmail	18610cd80a16e665	inbound	rentals@shortstayinn.com	kalsharajapaksa@gmail.com	Contact Short-Stay Inn - Atjehstraat (apartment) (minimum stay = 1 week)	<!doctype html>\n<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" dir="ltr" lang="en-GB">\n<head>\n<title>Contact Short-Stay Inn - Atjehstraat (apartment) (minimum stay = 1 week)</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<p>Hi Kalsha Rajapaksa,</p>\n<p>Thank you for the message.<br />\nYour request has been received. We will reply to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<p>Message:<br />\nHi, </p>\n<p>Would it be possible to know if this apartment is available from the 3rd of February (tomorrow) till march 3rd for an open month of stay? This will be with 2 people. </p>\n<p>Kind regards,<br />\nKalsha</p>\n<p>Kind regards,</p>\n<p>The Short-Stay Inn Team</p>\n<p>--<br />\nThis e-mail was sent from a <a href="https://shortstayinn.com/rental/atjehstraat-apartment-minimum-stay-1-week/">Atjehstraat (apartment) (minimum stay = 1 week)</a>.</p>\n</body>\n</html>	2023-02-02 06:25:48+00	{"gmail": {"id": "18610cd80a16e665", "threadId": "18610cd80a16e665", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Hi Kalsha Rajapaksa, Thank you for the message. Your request has been received. We will reply to you as soon as possible. Message: Hi, Would it be possible to know if this apartment is available from", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "text/html", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Received", "value": "from 446095089806 named unknown by gmailapi.google.com with HTTPREST; Thu, 2 Feb 2023 06:25:48 +0000"}, {"name": "X-Mailer", "value": "Postman SMTP 2.0.23 for WordPress (https://wordpress.org/plugins/post-smtp/)"}, {"name": "X-WPCF7-Content-Type", "value": "text/html"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/html; charset=UTF-8"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Short-Stay Inn <rentals@shortstayinn.com>"}, {"name": "Sender", "value": "rentals@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "To", "value": "kalsharajapaksa@gmail.com"}, {"name": "Reply-To", "value": "rentals@shor