229	124	gmail	1992f59ebe4a4180	inbound	ksuke0621wondall@gmail.com	info@enschedayinn.nl	Re: Introduction Location Manager - Alberto	Dear Sander and Alberto,\r\n\r\nThank you very much for your message. I understand that from now on I\r\nshould contact Alberto for operational matters.\r\n\r\nAlberto, I look forward to working with you.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nKeisuke\r\n\r\n\r\n2025年9月8日(月) 15:55 Short-Stay Inn <info@shortstayinn.com>:\r\n\r\n> Dear Keisuke Fujiwara,\r\n>\r\n> As I may have mentioned before, now that my colleague Alberto is back from\r\n> his holidays,he will take over a large part of the daily work.\r\n> From today onwards, Alberto will be your first point of contact for many\r\n> questions, while I will remain responsible for the administrative side.\r\n> Please see below who to contact for each type of question:\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Operational matters → Alberto* Alberto is our Location Manager and\r\n> personally takes care of everything on-site. Please contact him for:\r\n>\r\n>    - Cleaning schedules and extra towels or bed linen\r\n>    - Check-in or access questions (door code, keys)\r\n>    - Technicalissues (heating, appliances, hot water)\r\n>    - General facilities (washing machine, kitchen, WiFi, TV)\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> You can reach Alberto by phone or WhatsApp at * +31 6 41722332*, or via\r\n> the standard messaging system of Booking.com.\r\n> He speaks English, Spanish, German, Portuguese, and Dutch, so feel free to\r\n> contact him in the language that suits you best.\r\n>\r\n> Many useful answers can also be found here: https://notre.guide/CentralDayInn\r\n> .\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> *Administrative matters → Sander *For all administrative or financial\r\n> questions, please continue to contact me directly at info@shortstayinn.com\r\n> or by phone or WhatsApp at * +31 53 8200946* . Examples include:\r\n>\r\n>    - Invoices and payment questions\r\n>    - Deposit refunds or damage handling\r\n>    - Contracts, registration, or proof of deregistration\r\n>\r\n>\r\n> Many useful answers can also be found here:\r\n> https://notre.guide/ShortStayInn .\r\n>\r\n> Kind regards,\r\n>\r\n> Sander﻿\r\n>\r\n>\r\n	2025-09-09 16:40:33+00	{"gmail": {"id": "1992f59ebe4a4180", "threadId": "1992f59ebe4a4180", "labelIds": ["IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL", "INBOX"], "snippet": "Dear Sander and Alberto, Thank you very much for your message. I understand that from now on I should contact Alberto for operational matters. Alberto, I look forward to working with you. Kind regards,", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@enschedayinn.nl"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6214:5b0c:b0:70d:bc47:3772 with SMTP id ma12csp1969381qvb;        Tue, 9 Sep 2025 09:40:46 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "X-Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:651c:408c:b0:336:86c0:e2b4 with SMTP id 38308e7fff4ca-33b5a1020abmr20467631fa.14.1757436045919;        Tue, 09 Sep 2025 09:40:45 -0700 (PDT)"}, {"name": "ARC-Seal", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; t=1757436045; cv=none;        d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        b=Tuu74W0M4r47uZVaGXOdHL+BpDt1hcnA4/yiHqh7LdVxDyXnLfjXdS9Ex+4BlraQEk         z6a7TgXEIzhEqGAvvyVjQsP4rcZjgsxPW63KbZbs5Aaf3or8vi+8uasGVXfT5ID6+I8x         sF4Mja0N2PyzlGymxGnaRdKv3t7pZRYBi3cAiJUBpy+YG0rAyXMi1AsXu8I/qYp+CCHp         77rcJs2u95Nu8Lu9tlgLIH2I9wmp8wqNibm+VrTCn30RQoJHU8TD8N8euNI/vNCGz+I/         QmM7PkgbePKcDQhlQCpoD0JGxubEVJ7qnJTI4wd6BKKiM2FG290HTUUClaqDnB3bj6Ke         t30g=="}, {"name": "ARC-Message-Signature", "value": "i=1; a=rsa-sha256; c=relaxed/relaxed; d=google.com; s=arc-20240605;        h=to:subject:message-id:date:from:in-reply-to:references:mime-version         :dkim-signature;        bh=qhyFG0DYuxfV6bZ0NkAl3bINH0slHQT5FHzglh7YCa8=;        fh=hDcLZ2APqa3Qr0FwnNFeE9wvyZMpm/MR15u6kXGYRME=;        b=RAJ/WXt441/zAIF80d4ZmnatGbOISki86V/FUU2w/nGQ2WdrXJnqISQ//jufQsn2Ih         PC+n7y/FtoMfedjuNRAF7vMGwDuFWPKiVegmE0/2/tyO3Ufe8FZpfAbu94XBaf14jw