252	136	gmail	19e83af509843967	outbound	info@enschedayinn.nl	prakash.thanikkal@apollotyres.com	Your check in with Short-Stay Inn	Good afternoon,\r\n\r\nMy name is Alberto, and I will be your Location Manager during your stay. I\r\nam writing to provide your new check-in code, *2473*, which will be valid\r\nfor the entire day tomorrow.\r\n\r\nFor smoother communication, could you please share a WhatsApp-enabled phone\r\nnumber where I can reach you. I will be your primary point of contact for\r\nany non-administrative matters.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nAlberto\r\nLocation Manager\r\n+31 6 41722332\r\n	2026-06-01 14:56:04+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19e83af509843967", "threadId": "19e83abe0351b672", "labelIds": ["SENT"], "snippet": "Good afternoon, My name is Alberto, and I will be your Location Manager during your stay. I am writing to provide your new check-in code, 2473, which will be valid for the entire day tomorrow. For", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "MIME-Version", "value": "1.0"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Mon, 1 Jun 2026 16:56:04 +0200"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CALasHtsgpmir1EJONJXa78DhdWztESTT9FDsZsK1yCN_v-8Umw@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Your check in with Short-Stay Inn"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Guest House Ensche-Day Inn <info@enschedayinn.nl>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "Prakash.thanikkal@apollotyres.com"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\\"000000000000d362ed065332648b\\""}], "body": {"size": 0}, "parts": [{"partId": "0", "mimeType": "text/plain", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}], "body": {"size": 450, "data": ""}}, {"partId": "1", "mimeType": "text/html", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/html; charset=\\"UTF-8\\""}, {"name": "Content-Transfer-Encoding", "value": "quoted-printable"}], "body": {"size": 596, "data": "PGRpd