256	141	gmail	19f27a353407f622	inbound	brandscheffer@protonmail.com	info@shortstayinn.com	House Search	Hi Sander\n\nTrust all is well.\n\nI'm continuing my search for an apartment, but as you probably know, it's not easy here! I'm running into a practical problem and I'm hoping you might be able to help.\n\nBecause I have no history in Netherlands, I'm not able to provide all the documentation that seems to be normal here. One of the things I would like to include in my documentation is a letter from Short Stay Inn saying that I have contracted for some long term rentals with you over the last few years and that I always paid on time and have been a good tenant. Is that something you would be willing to do?\n\nI'm hoping that if I include at least a reference from a Dutch landlord, this will help reassure prospective landlords that I am not a financial risk or any other sort of risk.\n\nThanks for considering this! Equally if you happen to know of any apartments that are available here in Enschede, do let me know. I am mostly looking in Deventer because it is a little cheaper than Den Bosch, where I was originally looking. I have a budget of around 1500.\n\nThanks!\n\nBest - Brand\n\nBrand Scheffer\nNL number: +31 617 235 880\nUS number +1 714 955 2056\n\nSent with [Proton Mail](https://proton.me/mail/home) secure email.	2026-07-03 11:00:36+00	{"gmail": {"id": "19f27a353407f622", "threadId": "19f27a353407f622", "labelIds": ["UNREAD", "IMPORTANT", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL", "INBOX"], "snippet": "Hi Sander Trust all is well. I&#39;m continuing my search for an apartment, but as you probably know, it&#39;s not easy here! I&#39;m running into a practical problem and I&#39;m hoping you might be", "payload": {"partId": "", "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "info@shortstayinn.com"}, {"name": "Received", "value": "by 2002:a05:6a11:539a:b0:735:c338:8629 with SMTP id rj26csp477771pxb;        Fri, 3 Jul 2026 04:00:43 -